  T["Henry kills or incapacitates all bandits first, then frees Ester and escorts her to safety, optionally interrogating the last surviving bandit and sending him to prison."] = "亨利先杀死或打倒所有强盗，再放出伊丝特尔，护送她到安全的地方，还可以审问最后一个活着的强盗，把他送进监狱。"
