  T["Henry enters the beginner archery contest and wins. He receives an XP reward appropriate to the beginner difficulty."] = "亨利参加新手组射箭比赛并获胜，得到与新手难度相称的经验奖励。"
  T["Henry enters the advanced archery contest and wins. He receives an XP reward appropriate to the advanced difficulty."] = "亨利参加进阶组射箭比赛并获胜，得到与进阶难度相称的经验奖励。"
  T["Henry enters the expert archery contest and wins. He receives an XP reward appropriate to the expert difficulty."] = "亨利参加专家组射箭比赛并获胜，得到与专家难度相称的经验奖励。"
  T["Henry enters an archery contest at any difficulty and loses. He receives a consolation XP reward and forfeits his wager."] = "亨利参加射箭比赛（不论哪个难度）并落败。他得到一点安慰性的经验奖励，赌注归了对方。"
  T["Henry gains Bohuta's trust by drinking with him, surviving the party brawl, ringing the bell, and witnessing the sheep scene at dawn. Bohuta reveals Kuba's secret, Henry investigates the black book and reports to Ledecko, completing the quest."] = "亨利陪古德温喝酒，挺过酒会上的斗殴，敲响钟楼的钟，又在黎明时撞见羊的那一幕，由此赢得古德温的信任。古德温说出卢波的秘密，亨利查阅《拉泰罪犯实录》，打听到拉迪亚茨克的瑞奇，任务完成。"
  T["Henry accidentally reads the Ratay black book before Bohuta reveals the secret, learns about Hynek in Ledecko independently, and completes the quest without fully gaining Bohuta's trust through the drinking route."] = "古德温说出秘密之前，亨利无意中读到了《拉泰罪犯实录》，自己查到拉迪亚茨克的瑞奇，没有通过陪酒那条路完全赢得古德温的信任，也完成了任务。"
  T["Bohuta refuses to help Henry (due to failed drinking session, skipped mass, or canceled getDrunkWithBohuta), so Henry investigates the black book directly and reports to Ledecko to close the quest."] = "古德温不肯帮亨利（因为喝酒没喝好、没去布道，或 getDrunkWithBohuta 被取消），亨利只好直接去查罪犯实录，打听到拉迪亚茨克的线索后结束任务。"
  T["After completing findOutMoreAboutKuba, the quest transitions into the revenge follow-up quest q_revenge_auschitz_ledetchko rather than ending immediately."] = "完成 findOutMoreAboutKuba 之后，任务没有直接结束，而是转入复仇后续任务 q_revenge_auschitz_ledetchko。"
  T["Henry finds a cure and delivers it to the ailing Bedrich in time, restoring his health and allowing Bedrich to assist with the black book investigation."] = "亨利找到药，及时送给生病的拉泰文书，治好了他，文书因此能帮忙调查罪犯实录。"
  T["Henry fails to deliver the cure to Bedrich before the timeout expires, leaving Bedrich unable to help with the investigation."] = "计时结束前，亨利没能把药送到拉泰文书手里，文书帮不上调查的忙。"
  T["Henry participates in and successfully conducts the mass with Bohuta, earning Bohuta's goodwill and progressing toward his trust."] = "亨利和古德温一起完成了布道，赢得古德温的好感，离取得他的信任更近一步。"
  T["Henry fails or skips the mass, angering Bohuta and forcing the bohutaWontHelp path where Henry must find the black book on his own."] = "亨利布道失败或干脆没去，惹恼了古德温，只能走 bohutaWontHelp 这条路，自己去找罪犯实录。"
  T["Henry obtains the Avalon steel and brings it to the blacksmith, completing the errand. The quest ends after the steel is successfully delivered."] = "亨利弄到外国钢，交给铁匠，差事办完。钢送到之后任务结束。"
  T["Henry wakes in Rattay, speaks with Tereza across three dialog scenes, experiences the dream sequence, then meets Radzig Kobyla — completing the quest and transitioning into the main story. This is the only narrative ending; the quest is a linear prologue with no branching failure states."] = "亨利在拉泰醒来，在三段对话里和特丽莎交谈，经历一段梦境，然后见到拉德季·科比拉大人，任务完成并转入主线。这是唯一的剧情结局：这个任务是一段线性序章，没有分支，也没有失败状态。"
  T["Henry completes the full basic training, wins both the archery contest and the sword duel against Ptacek, then reports back to the Bailiff (Rychtar). He leaves Rattay's training ground having impressed Bernard."] = "亨利完成全部基础训练，射箭比赛和剑术对决都赢了卡蓬，然后回去向执政官复命。他让巴纳德刮目相看，离开了拉泰的训练场。"
  T["Henry completes the full basic training but loses the archery contest against Ptacek, then wins the sword duel and reports back to the Bailiff. Training is finished regardless of the bow result."] = "亨利完成全部基础训练，射箭比赛输给了卡蓬，剑术对决赢了，然后回去向执政官复命。不管射箭结果如何，训练都算完成。"
  T["Henry completes the full basic training, wins the archery contest but loses the sword duel against Ptacek, then reports back to the Bailiff. Training is finished regardless of the sword result."] = "亨利完成全部基础训练，射箭比赛赢了，剑术对决输给了卡蓬，然后回去向执政官复命。不管剑术结果如何，训练都算完成。"
  T["Henry completes the full basic training but loses both the archery contest and the sword duel, then reports back to the Bailiff. Bernard dismisses him having shown he still has much to learn."] = "亨利完成全部基础训练，但射箭比赛和剑术对决都输了，然后回去向执政官复命。巴纳德打发他走，说明他要学的还多。"
  T["Henry gathers all the required ingredients, brews the correct antidote, administers it to the cow, and waits for it to recover. The cow survives and the quest ends successfully."] = "亨利凑齐所需的材料，熬出正确的解药，喂给牛，等它恢复。牛活了下来，任务圆满结束。"
  T["Henry brews or uses the wrong antidote but gives it to the cow anyway, and the cow still recovers after waiting. The quest ends but with a less ideal remedy."] = "亨利熬错或用错了解药，还是喂给了牛，等了一阵，牛也康复了。任务结束，只是解药不太理想。"
  T["Henry steals the monstrance (pyx) and hides it in a neighbour's chest, then reports the theft to the bailiff, framing an innocent farmer. The quest ends with the neighbour facing false accusation."] = "亨利偷走圣体匣，藏进邻居的箱子，然后向执政官报案，陷害一个无辜的农夫。任务结束，邻居蒙受不白之冤。"
  T["The cow dies before Henry can administer the antidote. The quest is cancelled by the engine when CowDeath is completed."] = "亨利还没来得及喂解药，牛就死了。CowDeath 完成后，引擎取消了任务。"
  T["Henry steals the brocade and brings it directly to Miller Simon (Woyzeck path), completing the job without involving the assistant or going to Neuhoff. The quest ends with the brocade delivered to the miller."] = "亨利偷出锦缎，直接交给磨坊主西蒙（沃兹科路线），既不牵扯助手，也不去诺伊霍夫。任务以锦缎交到磨坊主手里结束。"
  T["Henry follows the assistant Michael to the fence at Neuhoff and delivers the brocade there, completing the alternative handoff path. The quest ends once the brocade reaches Neuhoff."] = "亨利跟着助手去诺伊霍夫找销赃人，把锦缎交到那里，走的是另一条交货路线。锦缎送到诺伊霍夫，任务结束。"
  T["The assistant Michael reaches the map boundary with the brocade still in his possession and escapes, causing the quest to be cancelled via QuestSystem.CancelQuest. Henry loses the brocade and the job fails."] = "助手带着锦缎跑到地图边界，逃之夭夭，任务经 QuestSystem.CancelQuest 取消。亨利丢了锦缎，差事失败。"
  T["Henry resolves the bullying of Novice Lukas through peaceful means — either by reporting the circators to the prior, successfully threatening them, or finding a diplomatic solution — then reports back to complete the quest."] = "亨利用和平的办法解决了学徒卢卡斯受欺负的事：向长老告发巡察使、成功吓住他们，或者找到别的妥协办法，然后回去复命，任务完成。"
  T["Henry reports the circators' misconduct to the prior or abbot, which counts as a successful resolution and feeds into the main completion path."] = "亨利向长老或院长告发巡察使的恶行，这算成功解决，会接入主要的完成路线。"
  T["Henry intimidates the circators into backing off, resolving the bullying through threats rather than official channels."] = "亨利吓得巡察使收了手，靠威胁而不是正式途径解决了欺凌的事。"
  T["Novice Lukas dies during the quest, causing the quest to be cancelled as a failure with no resolution."] = "学徒卢卡斯在任务中死亡，任务以失败取消，事情没有解决。"
  T["Both circators are killed by Henry, which immediately cancels the quest as a failure rather than resolving it through legitimate means."] = "亨利杀死了两个巡察使，任务立即以失败取消，算不上正当解决。"
  T["Henry is sent to solitary confinement, interrupting the quest and triggering a handoff to the monastery solitary objective in q_sazavaMonastery."] = "亨利被关了禁闭，任务中断，转交给 q_sazavaMonastery 里修道院禁闭的那个目标。"
  T["Henry obtains the cure, heals the captive bandit, interrogates him once healthy, and reports back to Racek. The captive survives and provides information about the counterfeiters."] = "亨利弄到药，治好被俘的强盗，等他好转后审问他，再回去向拉德季大人汇报。俘虏活了下来，供出了伪币团伙的内情。"
  T["Henry heals the captive and escorts him to the jail in Rataje rather than interrogating him on the spot, then reports to Racek. The captive is imprisoned alive."] = "亨利治好俘虏，没有就地审问，而是把他押到拉泰的监狱，再向拉德季大人汇报。俘虏活着被关押起来。"
  T["Henry kills the captive bandit himself, loots the letter from the body, and reports to Racek. The captive dies and the information is obtained through murder."] = "亨利亲手杀死被俘的强盗，从尸体上搜出信件，向拉德季大人汇报。俘虏死了，情报靠杀人得来。"
  T["Henry administers a bad cure (poison or wrong substance) to the captive, who dies from it. Henry then inspects the body and reports to Racek."] = "亨利给俘虏用了坏药（毒药或用错的东西），俘虏因此死亡。亨利检查尸体后向拉德季大人汇报。"
  T["The villagers lynch the captive before Henry can save him. Henry is teleported away during the lynch mob scene and must report to Racek with the captive dead."] = "亨利还没来得及救下俘虏，村民就对他动了私刑。私刑那一幕里亨利被传送走，只能在俘虏已死的情况下向拉德季大人汇报。"
  T["Henry steals the incriminating letter from the captive without killing or healing him, then reports to Racek with the document as evidence."] = "亨利既没杀死也没治好俘虏，从他身上偷走那封罪证信，带着这份证据向拉德季大人汇报。"
  T["Henry fails to obtain a cure in time and the captive dies from the plague. The quest proceeds to a failed state with the captive dead from illness."] = "亨利没能及时弄到药，俘虏死于瘟疫。任务进入失败状态，俘虏病死。"
  T["The quest is canceled or fails entirely, triggering the questFailed objective and bypassing the normal ending cutscene."] = "任务被取消或彻底失败，触发 questFailed 目标，跳过正常的结尾过场动画。"
  T["Henry helps Drahomira by gathering fumigation items, performing the fumigation ritual, consulting the apothecary, finding Lada's grave, and completing the incantation at the graveside with the apothecary. The ghost of Alois is laid to rest and a cross is erected at the quarry, concluding the quest with a reward from Kunhuta."] = "亨利帮德候米娅收集熏屋用的东西，做了烟熏仪式，请教药商，找到拉达的坟墓，又和药商一起在坟前念完咒语。阿洛伊斯的鬼魂得以安息，采石场立起一座十字架，草药师昆胡塔给了报酬，任务结束。"
  T["The quest is forcibly cancelled by the engine when Drahomira, Kunhuta, or Konyas (the apothecary) is killed at any point during the quest. No resolution is reached and the haunting remains unsettled."] = "只要德候米娅、昆胡塔或药商在任务中任何时候被杀，引擎就强行取消任务。事情没有了结，闹鬼也没有平息。"
  T["Henry gathers all three ritual items (tooth, branch, talisman), delivers them to the charlatan, obtains Loukota's shroud, and gives it to the charlatan. The charlatan is then publicly expelled from town by the brawlers in a cutscene."] = "亨利凑齐三样仪式用品（牙齿、树枝、护身符）交给江湖骗子，又弄到娄科塔的裹尸布交给他。随后在过场动画里，江湖骗子被一群打手当众赶出城。"
  T["The charlatan dies during the quest, causing it to be cancelled outright with no resolution for Loukota."] = "江湖骗子在任务中死亡，任务直接取消，娄科塔的事没有下文。"
  T["Henry kills one of Loukota's brothers (Petr or Marek) and the charlatan reports the crime to the authorities, causing the quest to be cancelled."] = "亨利杀死了娄科塔的一个兄弟（皮特或马克），江湖骗子向官府报案，任务取消。"
  T["Henry investigates the construction site murder, identifies Zmola as the killer, and has him arrested and brought to justice. The quest concludes with a report back to the quest giver (Divis, the quarry master, or Schaefer)."] = "亨利调查工地上的命案，认出凶手是莫拉，让他被逮捕法办。最后回去向任务发布人（戴卫斯大人、采石场矿工头或监工）汇报，任务结束。"
  T["Zmola flees the scene and escapes before Henry can apprehend him. Henry still reports back to the quest giver, but the killer is never brought to justice."] = "亨利还没抓住莫拉，他就逃离现场跑掉了。亨利还是回去向任务发布人汇报了，但凶手始终没有伏法。"
  T["Henry kills Zmola during the confrontation rather than arresting him. The quest can still conclude by reporting back to the quest giver, though justice is delivered by the sword rather than the law."] = "对峙时亨利没有逮捕莫拉，而是杀了他。任务仍可回去向发布人汇报而结束，只不过正义靠刀剑而不是律法伸张。"
  T["Zmola is killed before Henry has gathered enough evidence or reached the confrontation stage, making it impossible to properly resolve the murder investigation. The quest is cancelled."] = "亨利还没收集够证据、没走到对峙那一步，莫拉就被杀了，命案无法妥善了结。任务取消。"
  T["A critical NPC (Lesek before the skull investigation is complete, the doorman before speaking to the caretaker, or the knacker before skull authenticity is verified) is killed prematurely, blocking quest progression and causing the quest to be cancelled."] = "某个关键人物过早被杀（头骨调查完成前的雷士克、与监工谈话前的看门人、或核实头骨真伪前的屠户），任务无法推进，因而取消。"
  T["Schaefer (the caretaker) is killed before Henry has a return-to-quest-giver objective active, leaving no one to report to and causing the quest to be cancelled."] = "亨利还没接到回去找任务发布人的目标，监工就被杀了，没人可以汇报，任务取消。"
  T["Henry recovers the charcoal-burners' stolen loot and returns it to innkeeper Ondrej. The quest ends with Ondrej receiving the goods."] = "亨利追回被烧炭工抢走的东西，交给酒馆掌柜安德鲁。任务以安德鲁收到赃物结束。"
  T["Henry extorts or negotiates money from the colliers and returns the cash to Ondrej instead of the physical loot."] = "亨利从烧炭工那里敲诈或谈来一笔钱，没有交回原物，而是把现钱交给了安德鲁。"
  T["Henry recovers the stolen loot and returns it directly to Adam, the original victim, rather than to Ondrej."] = "亨利追回被抢的东西，没有交给安德鲁，而是直接还给原主亚当。"
  T["Henry recovers the extorted money and returns it directly to Adam, giving him back the value of what was stolen."] = "亨利追回被敲走的钱，直接还给亚当，补偿他被抢的损失。"
  T["Henry recovers Adam's stolen necklace and returns it to him, completing the quest with the most personal of the stolen items restored."] = "亨利追回亚当被抢的项链还给他，被抢的东西里最贴身的一件物归原主，任务完成。"
  T["Henry gives up on the quest after all the colliers are killed, leaving the matter unresolved. The quest is cancelled."] = "烧炭工都被杀光后，亨利放弃了任务，事情悬而未决。任务取消。"
  T["Adam is killed before Henry can complete the quest, causing it to be cancelled with the stolen goods never recovered."] = "亨利完成任务之前亚当被杀，任务取消，被抢的东西再也没追回来。"
  T["Ondrej is killed during the quest, removing the quest giver and causing the quest to be cancelled."] = "安德鲁在任务中被杀，任务发布人没了，任务取消。"
  T["Henry and the Bohemian forces successfully storm Talmberg, breach the gate or scale the walls, fight through the courtyard, and chase down the fleeing Toth. The quest concludes with a cutscene showing Radzig and the credits sequence rolling into the dream-of-father epilogue."] = "亨利和波希米亚军队攻破塔尔木堡，破门或翻墙而入，杀过庭院，追击逃跑的托思。任务以拉德季的过场动画收尾，接着是片尾字幕，再进入梦见父亲的尾声。"
  T["During the chase sequence after the castle falls, Henry rides outside the permitted boundary area instead of following Toth, triggering an immediate game-over screen with the reason ConquestFollowCapon or ConquestFled."] = "城堡陷落后的追击中，亨利没有跟着托思，而是骑出了允许的范围，立即出现游戏结束画面，原因是 ConquestFollowCapon 或 ConquestFled。"
  T["Henry and the Talmberg forces storm Vranik, breach both gates, clear the camp, and defeat the Cumans. The quest ends with the inner camp seized and a post-battle cutscene."] = "亨利和塔尔木堡的军队攻打弗拉尼克，攻破两道大门，扫清营地，打败库曼人。任务以攻占内营和一段战后过场动画结束。"
  T["Henry leaves the battle area during the assault, triggering an immediate game-over with the reason Q_IR_FledBattle."] = "进攻途中亨利离开战斗区域，立即游戏结束，原因是 Q_IR_FledBattle。"
  T["The getReinforcements objective is canceled (e.g. Divis is killed or the condition fails), triggering a game-over with reason qco_reinforcements before the battle even begins."] = "getReinforcements 目标被取消（比如戴卫斯被杀或条件不满足），战斗还没开始就游戏结束，原因是 qco_reinforcements。"
  T["Henry and the allied forces complete all phases of the counter-offensive battle, breaching the gates and seizing both the outer and inner camps. This is the sole narrative conclusion of this scripted battle sequence."] = "亨利和友军打完反攻战的全部阶段，攻破大门，拿下外营和内营。这是这场脚本战斗唯一的剧情结局。"
  T["Henry captures Jezek, delivers information to Racek, and brings the counterfeiting operation to justice. The main story path concludes with the workshop shut down and the criminals handed over to the authorities."] = "亨利抓获西杰克，把情报交给拉德季大人，伪币团伙被绳之以法。主线到此告一段落：作坊被查封，罪犯交给了官府。"
  T["Henry kills Ulrich during or after the initial chase, loots the documents from his body, and proceeds to deliver them to Fejfar without Ulrich's cooperation. Ulrich dies before the investigation is properly concluded."] = "亨利在最初的追击中或之后杀死伍尔里希，从尸体上搜出文件，没有他的配合也交给了费法尔。调查尚未正式了结，伍尔里希就死了。"
  T["Henry kills Rapota during the confrontation at the mill or camp rather than capturing him. The operation is still dismantled but Rapota does not face formal justice."] = "在磨坊或营地对峙时，亨利没有活捉拉波塔，而是杀了他。伪币团伙照样被捣毁，但拉波塔没有受到正式审判。"
  T["Henry walks away from Rapota during the execution sequence, allowing him to escape. The counterfeiting ringleader goes free."] = "行刑那一段亨利转身走开，放拉波塔逃走。伪币团伙的头目逍遥法外。"
  T["Henry reconciles with Ulrich, brings him to the workshop, and Ulrich spares Jezek during the confrontation. Jezek is captured peacefully and handed over."] = "亨利和伍尔里希和好，带他去作坊，对峙时伍尔里希饶了西杰克。西杰克被和平抓获并交了出去。"
  T["Henry brings Ulrich to the workshop but Ulrich turns on Henry over the fate of Jezek, forcing a fight. The alliance breaks down violently at the final confrontation."] = "亨利带伍尔里希去作坊，伍尔里希却为了西杰克的下场和亨利翻脸，两人只好动手。最后对峙时，这段联手以流血收场。"
  T["Henry finds the Beran family treasure and returns it (along with the goblet) to Mrs. Beran, the rightful owner. The debt is resolved in her favor."] = "亨利找到贝兰家的宝物，连同酒杯一起还给它真正的主人贝兰的妻子。欠债一事以对她有利的方式了结。"
  T["Henry finds the treasure and returns it to Mr. Beran rather than his wife, resolving the debt but not necessarily in the most just way."] = "亨利找到宝物，交给了贝兰而不是他妻子。欠债了结了，但未必最公道。"
  T["Henry recovers the debt money from Kunes and returns it to Mr. Beran after persuading him, without recovering the goblet."] = "亨利从库尼什那里追回欠款，说服贝兰后把钱交给他，但没追回酒杯。"
  T["Henry recovers the debt money from Kunes and returns it to Mr. Beran without persuading him to a better outcome."] = "亨利从库尼什那里追回欠款交给贝兰，没能说服他接受更好的结果。"
  T["Henry recovers the goblet and returns it to Mrs. Beran, helping her reclaim what was taken from her."] = "亨利找回酒杯还给贝兰的妻子，帮她要回了被夺走的东西。"
  T["Henry returns the recovered treasure in a general resolution path, closing out the quest."] = "亨利以一般的方式交还找回的宝物，任务结束。"
  T["Henry acted dishonorably during the quest, extorting or betraying Beran. This decreases Henry's reputation with the refugees faction."] = "亨利在任务中行事不光彩，敲诈或出卖了贝兰。这会降低亨利在难民阵营中的声望。"
  T["Kunes is killed during the quest, cutting off the possibility of a negotiated resolution to the debt."] = "库尼什在任务中被杀，欠债再也没法谈出结果。"
  T["Mr. Beran is killed during the quest, making a proper resolution of the debt impossible."] = "贝兰在任务中被杀，欠债一事无法妥善了结。"
  T["Mrs. Beran is killed during the quest, preventing her from receiving what is rightfully hers."] = "贝兰的妻子在任务中被杀，她应得的东西再也拿不到了。"
  T["Kunes defeats Henry in their confrontation, leaving the debt unresolved and Henry unconscious."] = "对峙中库尼什打败了亨利，亨利昏了过去，欠债的事没有着落。"
  T["Henry defeats Kunes in combat, forcing him to submit and admit the debt. The quest can then proceed to a resolution."] = "亨利打败库尼什，逼他服软，认下这笔债。之后任务可以继续推进到结局。"
  T["Henry successfully defends the trebuchet until the bandit force is reduced, then participates in the post-battle negotiation cutscene and the final prisoner exchange, completing the quest. This is the intended full completion path."] = "亨利守住投石机，直到强盗兵力被削弱，然后参加战后谈判的过场动画和最后的俘虏交换，任务完成。这是预设的完整完成路线。"
  T["Henry participates in the ritual, survives the attack by the two men (magor/magor2), and completes the quest. The afterAttack cutscene plays and the quest ends at the 'end' objective."] = "亨利参加仪式，挺过那两个男人（magor/magor2）的袭击，任务完成。afterAttack 过场动画播放后，任务在 'end' 目标结束。"
  T["Same as the normal completion but Henry also reports back to the herbalist Gertruda after the attack, triggering the afterAttackHerbalist objective before the quest ends."] = "和正常完成一样，只是亨利在遇袭后还回去向采药婆格特鲁德汇报，任务结束前触发 afterAttackHerbalist 目标。"
  T["One of the three girls (Vera, Zlata, or Kuta) is killed before the attack phase, causing the quest to be immediately canceled."] = "三个女孩（外瑞、泽拉塔、库泰）中有一个在遇袭阶段之前被杀，任务立即取消。"
  T["The herbalist Gertruda dies while the talkToHerbalist objective is active, causing the quest to be canceled."] = "采药婆格特鲁德在 talkToHerbalist 目标进行期间死亡，任务取消。"
  T["Henry flees the ritual area during the attack phase, triggering attackFlee and causing the girls to be killed and the quest to be canceled."] = "遇袭阶段亨利逃离仪式区域，触发 attackFlee，女孩们被杀，任务取消。"
  T["Henry enters the ritual area during the observeRitual phase but the interruptRitual objective is subsequently canceled (e.g. by leaving), causing the attack branch to cancel the quest."] = "observeRitual 阶段亨利进入了仪式区域，但 interruptRitual 目标随后被取消（比如因为离开），遇袭分支随即取消任务。"
  T["Henry successfully helps the gang acquire Cuman disguises, reports back to Ondrej after the final cutscene, and the quest ends normally. This is the standard successful completion path."] = "亨利帮那伙人弄到库曼人的伪装，最后的过场动画之后回去向安德鲁复命，任务正常结束。这是标准的成功完成路线。"
  T["The quest fails because one of the key NPCs (Ondrej, Fricek, Matus, Milomir, Bran, Olena, or Vasek) is killed. The BT immediately starts failQuest when any of these death-tracker objectives complete, which then cancels the quest."] = "关键人物（安德鲁、弗利兹、马修、米洛米尔、布兰、奥莱娜或瓦舍克）中有人被杀，任务失败。只要任何一个死亡监视目标完成，行为树就立即开始 failQuest，随后取消任务。"
  T["Henry successfully develops the village by restoring the church, achieving good income, and growing the population, then reports to Divis to complete the quest with a closing trialog cutscene."] = "亨利把村子建设起来：修复教堂、收入可观、人口增长，然后向戴卫斯汇报，任务以一段三方对话的过场动画结束。"
  T["The village's reputation with faction 96 drops to 0.15 or below while the daily income check is active, causing the quest to be automatically cancelled and the failure objective to be started."] = "在每日收入检查期间，村子在阵营 96 中的声望跌到 0.15 或更低，任务自动取消，失败目标随之开始。"
  T["Henry sides with Krkovicka in the butcher dispute; Spejlik and the old butcher are banished from Pribyslavitz."] = "屠夫之争中亨利站在乡常一边，兄浦和老屠夫被逐出普拉比西拉维奇。"
  T["Henry sides with Spejlik in the butcher dispute; Krkovicka and the old butcher are banished from Pribyslavitz."] = "屠夫之争中亨利站在兄浦一边，乡常和老屠夫被逐出普拉比西拉维奇。"
  T["Henry recruits the new baker (Petr) and banishes the old baker from Pribyslavitz."] = "亨利招来新面包师（西维尔斯特），把老面包师逐出普拉比西拉维奇。"
  T["Henry banishes the new baker (Petr) from Pribyslavitz, keeping the old baker."] = "亨利把新面包师（西维尔斯特）逐出普拉比西拉维奇，留下老面包师。"
  T["Henry denounces the poachers to the authorities, applying the law strictly."] = "亨利向官府告发偷猎者，严格执法。"
  T["Henry confiscates the poachers' catch as punishment but lets them stay."] = "亨利没收偷猎者的猎物作为惩罚，但允许他们留下。"
  T["Henry lets the poachers keep their catch and overlooks the offence."] = "亨利让偷猎者留着猎物，对这次违规睁一只眼闭一只眼。"
  T["Henry forgives the two lazy friends (Fricek and Matus) outright and lets them stay without conditions."] = "亨利原谅了两个偷懒的朋友（弗利兹和马修），无条件让他们留下。"
  T["Henry gives Fricek and Matus one last chance; they are reassigned to productive work."] = "亨利给弗利兹和马修最后一次机会，给他们重新安排了正经活计。"
  T["Henry banishes both Fricek and Matus from Pribyslavitz for their idleness."] = "亨利因为弗利兹和马修游手好闲，把两人都逐出普拉比西拉维奇。"
  T["Henry rules against Prachos and has the abusive husband punished."] = "亨利裁定马里斯理亏，惩罚了这个打老婆的丈夫。"
  T["Henry banishes Prachos's wife from Pribyslavitz."] = "亨利把马里斯的妻子逐出普拉比西拉维奇。"
  T["Henry leaves the Prachos household situation unchanged."] = "亨利对马里斯家的事不作改变。"
  T["Henry awards ownership of the disputed cow to Ruch."] = "亨利把那头有争议的牛判给鲁赫。"
  T["Henry awards ownership of the disputed cow to Lumir."] = "亨利把那头有争议的牛判给卢米尔。"
  T["Henry confiscates the hoarded grain for the village."] = "亨利没收囤积的粮食，充作村里的公粮。"
  T["Henry orders fair payment for the grain rather than confiscating it."] = "亨利没有没收粮食，而是下令按公道价付钱收购。"
  T["Henry protects the accused witch and allows her to remain in Pribyslavitz."] = "亨利保护被指为女巫的女人，让她留在普拉比西拉维奇。"
  T["Henry banishes the accused witch from Pribyslavitz."] = "亨利把被指为女巫的女人逐出普拉比西拉维奇。"
  T["Henry allows the lumberjacks to continue exporting wood outside the village."] = "亨利允许伐木工继续把木材运出村子。"
  T["Henry banishes the lumberjacks from Pribyslavitz; Malina and Kunes are also removed as a consequence."] = "亨利把伐木工逐出普拉比西拉维奇，马利纳和库尼什也因此被赶走。"
  T["Henry leaves the wood-export situation as it is, making no ruling."] = "亨利对木材外运的事维持原样，不作裁决。"
  T["Henry banishes Malina's wife from Pribyslavitz."] = "亨利把马利纳的妻子逐出普拉比西拉维奇。"
  T["Henry arranges a financial payoff to settle the dispute with Malina's wife, who then leaves."] = "亨利出钱打发马利纳的妻子，了结纠纷，她随后离开。"
  T["Henry leaves Malina's domestic situation unchanged; Malina himself is subsequently removed from the lumberjack camp."] = "亨利对马利纳的家事不作改变，马利纳本人随后被调离伐木营地。"
  T["Henry sends no reinforcements to Pribyslavitz."] = "亨利不往普拉比西拉维奇派援兵。"
  T["Henry sends only varlets as reinforcements to Pribyslavitz."] = "亨利只派仆从去普拉比西拉维奇增援。"
  T["Henry sends only lumberjacks as reinforcements to Pribyslavitz."] = "亨利只派伐木工去普拉比西拉维奇增援。"
  T["Henry sends both varlets and lumberjacks as reinforcements to Pribyslavitz."] = "亨利把仆从和伐木工都派去普拉比西拉维奇增援。"
  T["Henry rules that the latrine must be built far away from the village centre."] = "亨利裁定茅厕必须建在远离村中心的地方。"
  T["Henry reaches a compromise on the latrine placement acceptable to both parties."] = "亨利就茅厕的位置找到一个双方都能接受的折中办法。"
  T["Henry rules that people may relieve themselves anywhere, ignoring the hygiene complaint."] = "亨利裁定大家可以随地方便，不理会卫生方面的抱怨。"
  T["Henry orders the baker to produce large loaves of bread."] = "亨利命令面包师烤大个的面包。"
  T["Henry orders the baker to produce black bread for the villagers."] = "亨利命令面包师给村民烤黑面包。"
  T["Henry installs scales in the town hall to ensure fair bread weight; the newhomes_townhall_scales profile is enabled."] = "亨利在市政厅设了秤，保证面包分量足，并启用 newhomes_townhall_scales 配置。"
  T["Henry's ruling leaves the villagers hungry — the bread dispute is resolved against the people's interests."] = "亨利的裁决让村民挨饿：面包之争的结果损害了村民的利益。"
  T["Henry rescues Kolikator from the bandit camp, escorts him through Pribyslavitz, attends the trialog with Divis, and reports to the Rattay bailiff who rings the bell to welcome the new settlers."] = "亨利从强盗营地救出马略，护送他走过普拉比西拉维奇，参加与戴卫斯的三方对话，再向拉泰执政官汇报，执政官敲钟欢迎新来的定居者。"
  T["Kolikator is killed before the quest can be completed, causing the quest to be cancelled and all related activities to shut down."] = "任务完成之前马略被杀，任务取消，所有相关活动随之终止。"
  T["The Rattay bailiff is killed after the quest has started, making it impossible to complete the settlement ceremony and cancelling the quest."] = "任务开始后拉泰执政官被杀，定居仪式无法进行，任务取消。"
  T["Henry recruits settlers for the new village by talking to various candidates across the region. The quest runs as a persistent background tracker with no single terminal ending — each successful recruit is migrated to the new settlement and the quest remains active as long as the parent DLC questline is active."] = "亨利在各地找人谈话，为新村子招募定居者。这个任务作为常驻的后台追踪器运行，没有单一的最终结局：每招到一个人，就把他迁到新定居点。只要所属的 DLC 任务线仍在进行，这个任务就一直保持激活。"
  T["The minigame objective is completed (either by failure or a version-migration patch), which triggers an immediate DeactivateQuest call and shuts down the entire recruitment quest prematurely."] = "小游戏目标被完成（失败或版本迁移补丁导致），立即触发 DeactivateQuest，整个招募任务提前终止。"
  T["Matus dies before being recruited, completing the matusIsDead objective and causing the game to deactivate his recruitment modifier, permanently removing him as a candidate for the new settlement."] = "马修在被招募之前死亡，matusIsDead 目标完成，游戏停用他的招募修正，他永远不再是新定居点的候选人。"
  T["Fritz dies before being recruited, completing the fritzIsDead objective and causing the game to deactivate his recruitment modifier, permanently removing him as a candidate for the new settlement."] = "弗利兹在被招募之前死亡，fritzIsDead 目标完成，游戏停用他的招募修正，他永远不再是新定居点的候选人。"
  T["Henry successfully defends Johana through the trial process, gathering testimonies and supporting her case. The trial ends happily with Johana acquitted and free."] = "亨利在审判中成功为乔汉卡辩护，收集证词，支持她的立场。审判圆满结束，乔汉卡被判无罪，重获自由。"
  T["Henry fails to start the trial in time; the overtime expires and the trial is skipped, leading to a bad outcome for Johana. Henry must then speak with Nikotyn to learn what happened."] = "亨利没能按时开始审判，时限一过，审判被跳过，乔汉卡的结局很糟。之后亨利得去找尼可丹姆斯修士问问发生了什么。"
  T["Johana dies during the quest, causing it to be cancelled. The journal records her death and the quest ends without resolution."] = "乔汉卡在任务中死亡，任务取消。日志记下她的死，任务没有结果就此结束。"
  T["Henry commits a crime against Johana (murder, assault, theft, or shooting at her), causing the quest to be cancelled immediately."] = "亨利对乔汉卡犯下罪行（谋杀、袭击、偷窃或朝她射箭），任务立即取消。"
  T["Henry speaks heresy during the quest, triggering an immediate game over screen."] = "亨利在任务中说了异端言论，立即出现游戏结束画面。"
  T["The inquisitor is killed during the jail/trial phase, triggering an immediate game over."] = "审判者在关押或审判阶段被杀，立即游戏结束。"
  T["Henry successfully finds Adela, deals with Henslin (scares him off, defeats him, or kills him), convinces Adela to leave, escorts her safely to Sazava, and the quest ends with her safe. This is the primary successful resolution."] = "亨利找到阿黛拉，摆平亨斯林（吓跑、打败或杀死），劝阿黛拉离开，平安护送她到莎邵，任务以她安然无恙结束。这是主要的成功结局。"
  T["Henry escorts Adela but Henslin's men ambush them on the road; Henry defeats the ambush party and then escorts Adela safely to Sazava."] = "亨利护送阿黛拉途中遭到亨斯林手下伏击，他打退伏击的人，平安护送阿黛拉到莎邵。"
  T["Adela is killed during the quest, either by Henry or by Henslin's men, causing the quest to be cancelled and fail."] = "阿黛拉在任务中被杀（亨利或亨斯林的手下所为），任务取消并失败。"
  T["Henry takes too long to act while Adela is with Henslin; the timeout expires, Adela is left beaten and bloodied, and the quest fails."] = "阿黛拉和亨斯林在一起时亨利迟迟不动手，时限一过，阿黛拉被打得头破血流，任务失败。"
  T["Henry convinces Adela to leave but then abandons her during the escort; the adelaGoesHomeTimer expires, Adela gives up and goes home alone, and the quest fails."] = "亨利劝动阿黛拉离开，护送途中却丢下了她。adelaGoesHomeTimer 到期，阿黛拉心灰意冷，独自回家，任务失败。"
  T["Henry strikes Adela during the quest, which immediately triggers a quest failure and makes Adela hostile or unwilling to cooperate."] = "亨利在任务中打了阿黛拉，立即触发任务失败，阿黛拉也变得敌对或不肯配合。"
end)
fill(function(T)
  T["Henry kills Henslin in front of Adela while she is conscious and present; she witnesses the murder, becomes horrified, and the quest fails."] = "亨利当着清醒的阿黛拉杀了亨斯林。她亲眼看到杀人，吓坏了，任务失败。"
  T["The parent quest q_dlc_revelation is cancelled externally, which propagates a cancellation into this quest and forces it to fail."] = "父任务 q_dlc_revelation 在外部被取消，取消连带传到本任务，本任务只能失败。"
  T["Henry confronts Henslin but loses the fight; a cutscene plays showing Henry's defeat and the quest fails."] = "亨利与亨斯林正面交锋但打输了，过场动画播出亨利落败的一幕，任务失败。"
  T["Henry wins all of Ambroz's money at dice across three rounds, then convinces him to give up gambling. Ambroz quits and the tailor's wife is relieved."] = "亨利掷了三轮骰子，赢光安布洛斯的钱，再劝他戒赌。安布洛斯从此不赌了，裁缝的妻子松了口气。"
  T["Henry gets Ambroz blackout drunk, steals his money while he is passed out, then convinces him he lost it all at dice. Ambroz gives up gambling, though through deception."] = "亨利把安布洛斯灌得不省人事，趁他昏睡偷走他的钱，再让他相信钱是掷骰子输光的。安布洛斯戒了赌，只不过是被骗的。"
  T["Henry fails to help Ambroz through one of several bad choices: annoying him, stealing from him openly, being nasty after winning, getting too drunk himself, or letting Ambroz leave for Kuttenberg uncontested. The quest is cancelled."] = "亨利做错了某一步，没能帮到安布洛斯：惹恼了他、当面偷他的钱、赢了之后出言刻薄、自己喝得烂醉，或者任由他去了库滕堡。任务取消。"
  T["Henry kills either Ambroz or the tailor's wife during the quest, triggering an immediate quest failure and leaving Johanna in shock."] = "亨利在任务中杀了安布洛斯或裁缝的妻子，任务立即失败，乔汉卡大受震动。"
  T["Henry completes the penitent pilgrimage by visiting the chapel shrines, praying at the Maria statue, donating to Bohuta, and fulfilling his promise. The quest ends with Henry having done full penance for his sins."] = "亨利完成赎罪朝圣：拜访各处小教堂的圣祠，在圣母像前祈祷，捐钱给古德温，兑现自己的承诺。他为自己的罪孽做了完整的忏悔，任务结束。"
  T["Henry completes the pilgrimage and also retrieves and returns Bohuta's stolen book before fulfilling his promise. This is the most thorough completion of the quest."] = "亨利完成朝圣，并在兑现承诺之前找回古德温被偷的书，还给了他。这是这个任务最完整的完成方式。"
  T["Henry completes the pilgrimage via the alternative distance-based path, interacting with the player book position marker rather than speaking directly with Bohuta, then completing the penitent pilgrimage."] = "亨利走另一条按距离判定的路线完成朝圣：不直接找古德温谈，而是与玩家书本的位置标记互动，然后完成赎罪朝圣。"
  T["Henry investigates the murders, identifies the killer, deals with him (kills or hands over), reports to Johanka, and the quest ends successfully. Sir Radzig may order the execution of the killer after being told."] = "亨利调查几起命案，查出凶手，把他摆平（杀死或交给官府），再向乔汉卡汇报，任务圆满结束。拉德季大人得知后可能下令处决凶手。"
  T["The parent quest (q_dlc_revelation) fails while Henry has already started reporting to Johanka, causing this quest to be cancelled and the log_finalFail entry to fire."] = "亨利已经开始向乔汉卡汇报时，父任务（q_dlc_revelation）失败，本任务随之取消，触发 log_finalFail 日志条目。"
  T["The master quest fails (mqFailed objective completes), triggering cancelQuest and finalCleanup, which cancels all active objectives and ends the quest without resolution."] = "主任务失败（mqFailed 目标完成），触发 cancelQuest 和 finalCleanup，取消所有进行中的目标，任务没有结果就此结束。"
  T["Henry retrieves the treasure, donates all of it to the Church (parson, bailiff, or infirmarium), and reports back to Pavel, who is pleased with the outcome."] = "亨利找回宝藏，全数捐给教会（教区牧师、执政官或医护所），再回去向帕瓦尔复命，帕瓦尔对结果很满意。"
  T["Henry retrieves the treasure but keeps some or all of it for himself rather than donating it fully, leaving Pavel disappointed."] = "亨利找回宝藏，却留下一部分或全部归自己，没有全数捐出，帕瓦尔很失望。"
  T["Henry failed to retrieve the treasure before the Cumans left with it; he returns to Pavel empty-handed with only a partial remnant left in the stash."] = "亨利没能在库曼人带着宝藏离开之前把它找回来，只能空手回去见帕瓦尔，藏宝处只剩下一点零头。"
  T["Pavel dies during the quest, triggering an automatic quest failure and cancellation."] = "帕瓦尔在任务中死亡，任务自动失败并取消。"
  T["Henry gives up on the quest entirely, causing it to fail without completing Pavel's mission."] = "亨利彻底放弃了任务，帕瓦尔托付的事没有办成，任务失败。"
  T["Johanka is fully acquitted and her reputation is restored. Henry gathered enough evidence and made the right arguments during the trial to achieve the best possible verdict, with Matej also cured."] = "乔汉卡被宣判完全无罪，名誉得到恢复。亨利在审判中收集了足够的证据，论点也说对了，拿到最好的判决，马蒂亚斯的病也治好了。"
  T["Johanka is acquitted with a good verdict. Henry presented sufficient evidence and testimony during the trial to secure her release, though not the ideal outcome."] = "乔汉卡被判无罪，结果不错。亨利在审判中拿出了足够的证据和证词，让她获释，只是不算最理想的结局。"
  T["Johanka is condemned by the inquisitor. Either Henry skipped the trial, failed to gather enough evidence, or the judgment score was too low, resulting in the worst outcome for Johanka."] = "乔汉卡被审判者定罪。要么亨利错过了审判，要么证据收集不够，要么判决得分太低，对乔汉卡来说这是最坏的结局。"
  T["Henry never attended the trial. The skipTrial objective fires, cleanup_badEnd runs automatically, and Johanka is condemned without Henry ever participating."] = "亨利始终没有出席审判。skipTrial 目标触发，cleanup_badEnd 自动运行，乔汉卡在亨利缺席的情况下被定罪。"
  T["Henry takes the dog (Vorech) as a companion. The dog is reassigned to Henry as its new master and the tutorial overlay for the dog companion is triggered."] = "亨利收下狗（呆呆）做伙伴。狗的主人改为亨利，并弹出狗伙伴的教学提示。"
  T["The player completes the E3 2017 combat demo by triggering the endQuest trigger, which fires the 'end' objective and transitions to the next quest (q_raubritter). This is the sole narrative endpoint of this linear demo quest."] = "玩家触发 endQuest 触发器，完成 E3 2017 战斗演示，'end' 目标随之触发，转入下一个任务（q_raubritter）。这是这段线性演示任务唯一的剧情终点。"
  T["Henry successfully gains entry to the Sázava monastery by obtaining the required document and/or purse, traveling to the monastery, and either placing his belongings in the chest or putting on a novice robe. This is the intended completion of the quest."] = "亨利弄到所需的文书或钱袋，来到莎邵修道院，把随身物品放进箱子或换上学徒袍，顺利进入修道院。这是这个任务预设的完成方式。"
  T["The quest is forcibly canceled because Antonin or one of the novices inside the monastery was killed. The engine calls CancelQuest directly when antoninOrNoviceIsDead is completed while the quest is active."] = "安东尼斯或修道院里的某个学徒被杀，任务被强制取消。任务进行中只要 antoninOrNoviceIsDead 完成，引擎就直接调用 CancelQuest。"
  T["Henry follows Ptacek out of Rattay and rides with him to the ruined camp, triggering the final cutscene and ending the game. This is the primary intended ending of KCD1."] = "亨利跟着汉斯·卡蓬离开拉泰，和他一起骑马去废弃的营地，触发最终过场动画，游戏结束。这是《天国：拯救》本篇预设的主要结局。"
  T["Henry fails to follow Ptacek out of Rattay in time, so a stand-in NPC appears in Rattay for Henry to speak to, after which the final cutscene still plays and the game ends. This is the fallback path for players who dawdle."] = "亨利没能及时跟上卡蓬离开拉泰，于是拉泰出现一个替身 NPC 供亨利交谈，之后仍会播放最终过场动画，游戏结束。这是给磨蹭的玩家准备的后备路线。"
  T["If the q_loveLetter quest is active and unfinished when the final marker fires, the quest briefly redirects Henry via Capon before restoring the end-game marker and completing normally. The game still ends via the standard cutscene."] = "如果最终标记触发时 q_loveLetter 任务还在进行且没完成，本任务会先短暂地让亨利绕去找卡蓬，再恢复终局标记，正常完成。游戏仍以标准过场动画结束。"
  T["Henry successfully escapes Talmberk after Zikmund's army arrives, either by jumping off the rampart or bribing/persuading/disguising his way through the outer gate, then rides toward Skalitz. This is the intended completion of the quest."] = "西格斯蒙德的大军到达后，亨利从塔尔木堡逃了出来：要么从城墙上跳下，要么靠贿赂、说服或乔装混出外门，然后骑马奔向斯卡里茨。这是这个任务预设的完成方式。"
  T["Henry defeats all three fighters in the Rataje fight club and is crowned the champion. He wins the full prize money from each fighter."] = "亨利在拉泰的拳赛中打败全部三名对手，成为冠军，从每名对手那里赢得全额奖金。"
  T["Henry is defeated in one of the fights and loses the bout. The fight club ends in failure for Henry."] = "亨利在其中一场比赛中被打败，输掉了这一局。拳赛以亨利失利告终。"
  T["Henry wins the fights but receives reduced prize money from one or more fighters, having already beaten them in a previous encounter."] = "亨利赢了比赛，但之前已经打败过其中一个或几个对手，所以从他们那里拿到的奖金减少了。"
  T["Henry defeats all the fighters in the Skalice fight club, including the Cuman King, and collects his winnings. The quest ends with Henry victorious and paid."] = "亨利在斯卡里茨的拳赛中打败所有对手，包括库曼人国王，领到奖金。任务以亨利获胜、拿到报酬结束。"
  T["A key NPC (the speaker, Cuman King, Ase, or Asa) dies before the fight club can proceed, causing the quest to be cancelled."] = "拳赛还没开始，关键人物（发言人、库曼人国王、阿什或阿萨）中就有人死亡，任务取消。"
  T["Henry defeats all four fight club opponents, completing the full circuit of brawlers. The fight club activity is fully cleared and a skill book reward is granted."] = "亨利打败全部四名对手，打完整轮拳赛。拳赛活动全部完成，奖励一本技能书。"
  T["Henry is knocked unconscious during a bout or leaves the fight area, losing the current fight. The quest remains open and Henry can attempt fights again."] = "亨利在比赛中被打晕，或离开了比赛区域，输掉这一场。任务仍然开放，亨利可以再来挑战。"
  T["Henry completes all tasks for Stephanie — wine, horse, and tiara with moldavite — then dresses in her shirt, completing the romantic quest successfully."] = "亨利替斯蒂芬妮夫人办完所有事（葡萄酒、马，还有镶绿玻陨石的冠冕），然后穿上她的衬衣，这段风流任务圆满完成。"
  T["A key NPC (engraver, Stephanie, Konrad, the groom, or the horse) dies during the quest, causing it to be cancelled with no resolution."] = "关键人物（雕刻师、斯蒂芬妮夫人、康拉德·哈根、马夫，或那匹马）在任务中死亡，任务取消，没有结果。"
  T["Henry wins the archery contest with more than 15 hits, impressing Vatzek and earning the best result. He can play again in the future."] = "亨利射中超过 15 次，赢得射箭比赛，让瓦特泽克刮目相看，拿到最好的成绩。以后还可以再来比。"
  T["Henry wins the archery contest with 15 or fewer hits, beating both NPC competitors. Vatzek acknowledges the win."] = "亨利射中 15 次或更少，赢得射箭比赛，胜过两名 NPC 对手。瓦特泽克承认他赢了。"
  T["Henry finishes in second place in the archery contest, neither winning nor coming last."] = "亨利在射箭比赛中得了第二名，既没赢也不是垫底。"
  T["Henry finishes last in the archery contest, losing to both NPC competitors."] = "亨利在射箭比赛中垫底，输给了两名 NPC 对手。"
  T["Henry left the firing area during the contest, which counts as cheating and disqualifies him with a score of -1."] = "比赛中亨利离开了射击区域，算作作弊，被取消资格，记 -1 分。"
  T["Henry attacked one of the archery contestants during the minigame, triggering the assault path and ending the contest early."] = "小游戏进行中亨利攻击了一名参赛者，触发袭击分支，比赛提前结束。"
  T["Vacek, the archery organiser, is killed, causing the quest to be cancelled outright."] = "射箭比赛的组织者瓦特泽克被杀，任务直接取消。"
  T["Henry finds the chest, collects the sword and armor from it, then visits the blacksmith to sharpen the sword, completing the combat tutorial sequence. This is the only narrative path the quest supports."] = "亨利找到箱子，从里面拿出剑和盔甲，再去找铁匠把剑磨好，完成战斗教学。这个任务只支持这一条剧情路线。"
  T["Henry retrieves the treasure and returns it to the quest giver, completing the stealth training exercise. The giver delivers a closing dialogue and the quest ends."] = "亨利找回宝物，交还给任务发布人，完成潜行训练。发布人说完收尾的话，任务结束。"
  T["Henry betrays Matus and Fricek to Sir Borek, leading to their execution at the gallows while Ondrej goes free. Henry earns the Judas achievement for this outcome."] = "亨利向罗巴德大人出卖了马修和弗利兹，两人被送上绞架，安德鲁却逍遥法外。这个结局会让亨利获得成就“犹大”。"
  T["Henry reports the assault to Borek instead of helping Matus steal the money, ultimately resulting in Ondrej being hanged while Matus and Fricek escape justice."] = "亨利没有帮马修偷钱，而是向罗巴德告发了这次袭击，最终安德鲁被吊死，马修和弗利兹逃过了制裁。"
  T["All three brothers — Ondrej, Matus, and Fricek — are hanged. Henry earns the Judas achievement for engineering the deaths of all involved parties."] = "安德鲁、马修和弗利兹这三个难兄难弟全被吊死。亨利一手促成了所有相关的人送命，因此获得成就“犹大”。"
  T["Matus and/or Fricek die before Henry can snitch to Borek, causing the quest to be cancelled with no execution outcome."] = "亨利还没来得及向罗巴德告密，马修和弗利兹中就有人死了，任务取消，没有处决的结局。"
  T["Ondrej dies before the hanging can take place and neither ondrejHang nor allHang has been started, causing the quest to be cancelled outright."] = "绞刑执行之前安德鲁就死了，ondrejHang 和 allHang 都还没开始，任务直接取消。"
  T["Soldiers are already at the quarry when Henry tries to steal the money bag, making the theft impossible and cancelling the quest via the patch5 failsafe path."] = "亨利去偷钱袋时，士兵已经到了采石场，偷不成了，任务经由 patch5 的保险路线取消。"
  T["Henry recovers the necklace through any means and returns it to Ptacek, completing the quest. The love letter subplot may or may not be active."] = "亨利用随便什么办法拿回项链，还给卡蓬，任务完成。情书那条支线可能正在进行，也可能没有。"
  T["Henry wins the dice tournament, collects the necklace from the chest or winner, and returns it to Ptacek."] = "亨利赢下骰子大奖赛，从箱子里或从赢家手里拿到项链，还给卡蓬。"
  T["Plch wins the tournament; Henry tracks him down, gets the necklace from him, and returns it to Ptacek."] = "佩丘纳赢了大奖赛，亨利找到他，从他手里拿到项链，还给卡蓬。"
  T["Henry negotiates with the bandit chief after round 2, obtains the necklace directly from him, and returns it to Ptacek."] = "第二轮之后亨利和强盗头目谈判，直接从他手里拿到项链，还给卡蓬。"
  T["Henry steals the necklace from the chest or stash without winning the tournament or negotiating, then returns it to Ptacek."] = "亨利没赢大奖赛，也没谈判，直接从箱子或藏匿处偷走项链，还给卡蓬。"
  T["Henry reveals Adam's identity to the bandit chief, leading to Adam's death; Henry may still recover the necklace but at the cost of Adam's life."] = "亨利向强盗头目揭穿了安塞尔姆大人的身份，害他丧命。亨利也许还能拿回项链，但代价是安塞尔姆的命。"
  T["After the murder investigation, Henry accuses someone and Adam kills the accused person; the quest can still conclude with returning the necklace."] = "命案调查之后，亨利指控了某人，安塞尔姆随即杀了被指控的人，任务仍可以交还项链收尾。"
  T["Henry finds Father Simon being held by bullies, rescues him through combat, persuasion, money, or intimidation, then reports back to the farmer. The quest ends with the farmer rewarded and Simon safe."] = "亨利发现西蒙神父被一伙恶棍扣着，靠打斗、劝说、给钱或恐吓救出他，再回去向农夫复命。任务以农夫得到报偿、西蒙平安无事结束。"
  T["Either Father Simon or the Skalice parson dies during the quest, causing the quest to be cancelled as both key clerics are lost."] = "西蒙神父或斯卡里茨的牧师在任务中死亡，两位关键的神职人员缺了一位，任务取消。"
  T["The farmer who gave Henry the quest is killed, making it impossible to complete the quest and causing it to be cancelled."] = "给亨利派任务的农夫被杀，任务无法完成，因而取消。"
  T["Henry kills both bullies instead of driving them off or using a non-lethal approach, then reports back to the farmer. The quest still completes but Henry took lethal action against the thugs."] = "亨利没有赶走恶棍，也没用不伤人命的办法，而是把两人都杀了，然后回去向农夫复命。任务照样完成，只是亨利对这伙人下了死手。"
  T["Henry defeats Jan Zajic in a duel, arrests him, and delivers him to Mikulas. The poacher ring is brought to justice through lawful means."] = "亨利在决斗中打败韩内津·黑尔，逮捕他，交给猎人尼古拉斯。偷猎团伙依法受到制裁。"
  T["Henry kills Jan Zajic during the duel at the glade. He recovers Zajic's ring and brings it to Mikulas to close the case."] = "亨利在林间空地的决斗中杀了韩内津·黑尔，取回黑尔的戒指交给尼古拉斯，就此结案。"
  T["Jan Zajic successfully flees during the pursuit and escapes justice. The quest is cancelled with the poacher unpunished."] = "追捕途中韩内津·黑尔成功逃脱，逍遥法外。任务取消，偷猎者没有受到惩罚。"
  T["Mikulas, the quest giver, is killed during the quest. Without him the investigation cannot be concluded and the quest is cancelled."] = "任务发布人尼古拉斯在任务中被杀。没有他，调查无法收尾，任务取消。"
  T["Enough key NPCs (Ondrej, Tomas, Marketa, and/or Radan) are killed that the investigation can no longer proceed, forcing the quest to cancel."] = "关键人物（安德鲁、汤姆、玛格丽特、拉丹）死了太多，调查无法继续，任务被迫取消。"
  T["Henry chooses to deal with Zajic through the trap option, handing the matter off to the q_zajicsTrap questline. This quest is cancelled and the follow-up quest activates."] = "亨利选择用设陷阱的办法对付黑尔，把事情交给 q_zajicsTrap 任务线。本任务取消，后续任务随之激活。"
  T["Henry weeds the garden flawlessly — all required herbs are present at full count and every weed is completely removed. Nicodemus is fully satisfied and awards the best reward."] = "亨利除草做得无可挑剔：所需的草药一株不少，杂草拔得干干净净。尼可丹姆斯修士十分满意，给了最好的报酬。"
  T["Henry weeds the garden adequately — the required herbs are mostly present but not at full count, or a small number of weeds remain within tolerance. Nicodemus accepts the work and gives a standard reward."] = "亨利除草做得还过得去：所需的草药大致都在但不够数，或者剩下少量杂草，在容许范围内。尼可丹姆斯修士接受了这活儿，给了一般的报酬。"
  T["Henry leaves too many weeds in the garden (any weed species exceeds 5 or combined weeds exceed 10). Nicodemus sends him back to redo the job; after three such failures the quest is failed outright."] = "亨利在园子里留下太多杂草（某一种杂草超过 5 株，或杂草合计超过 10 株）。尼可丹姆斯修士让他回去重做。这样失败三次，任务直接失败。"
  T["Henry picks so many of the required medicinal herbs that fewer than 95 of the expected 105 remain in the garden. The work is considered a catastrophic failure and the quest ends badly."] = "亨利把要留的药草拔得太多，园子里原本应有 105 株，剩下不到 95 株。这活儿算是彻底搞砸了，任务以糟糕的结局收场。"
  T["The NPC Nikodem (Nicodemus) is killed before the quest concludes. The quest is immediately cancelled with no reward."] = "尼可丹姆斯修士在任务结束前被杀。任务立即取消，没有报酬。"
  T["Henry finds the runaway horse Pie, rides it back to the stable parking area, dismounts it there, then collects his reward from the groom. The quest ends successfully with full payment."] = "亨利找到跑掉的马阿派，骑回马厩的停马处，在那里下马，再找马夫领赏。任务圆满结束，报酬全额到手。"
  T["Henry fails to return the horse before the quest timer runs out, causing the quest to be cancelled automatically."] = "任务计时结束前亨利没能把马送回，任务自动取消。"
  T["The head groom dies during the quest, making it impossible to complete, and the quest is cancelled."] = "马夫长在任务中死亡，任务无法完成，因而取消。"
  T["The horse Pie is killed during the quest, making return impossible and causing the quest to be cancelled."] = "马匹阿派在任务中被杀，送不回去了，任务取消。"
  T["Henry uses the 'possess horse' action to claim Pie as his own rather than returning it, which is treated as theft and cancels the quest."] = "亨利用“占有马匹”的操作把阿派据为己有，没有送回去，这算偷窃，任务取消。"
  T["Henry is knocked unconscious near Bodlak during the quest, causing all NPCs to be repositioned and the quest to be cancelled."] = "亨利在任务中于烧炭工附近被打晕，所有 NPC 被重新安置，任务取消。"
  T["Henry successfully accompanies Ptacek on the hunting trip, rescues him from the Cumans after the boar hunt goes wrong, and the two share a closing dialog at camp. The quest ends normally with the cleanup and optional revenge sub-quest unlocked."] = "亨利陪卡蓬去打猎，猎野猪出了岔子，他从库曼人手里救出卡蓬，两人在营地说完最后的对话。任务正常收尾，可选的复仇支线随之解锁。"
  T["Henry sneaks into the Cuman camp without killing both guards and frees Ptacek covertly. The quest still resolves with the closing dialog and cleanup, but Henry avoided open combat."] = "亨利潜入库曼人营地，没有杀掉两个守卫，悄悄放出了卡蓬。任务仍以最后的对话收尾，只是亨利避开了正面交战。"
  T["Henry abandons the wounded Ptacek and flees too far from the Cuman camp, triggering a game-over cutscene. Ptacek is left to die and the quest fails."] = "亨利丢下受伤的卡蓬，逃得离库曼人营地太远，触发游戏结束的过场动画。卡蓬被弃之不顾，任务失败。"
  T["Henry recovers the stolen silver from Carter (by persuasion or force) and returns it to Miller Simon, who rewards him and the quest ends with Simon's closing dialogue."] = "亨利从车夫那里追回被偷的银子（靠说服或武力），还给磨坊主西蒙。西蒙给了报酬，任务以西蒙的收尾对话结束。"
  T["Henry kills Carter to take the silver rather than letting him surrender it, completing killCarter and then delivering the silver to Simon."] = "亨利没让车夫自己交出银子，而是杀了他夺走银子，完成 killCarter，再把银子交给西蒙。"
  T["Henry infiltrates Vranik, rescues Zbysek, and both escape together. Henry returns to Rataj with Zbysek and reports to Radzig's men, completing the mission successfully."] = "亨利潜入弗拉尼克，救出巴舍克，两人一起逃了出来。亨利带着巴舍克回到拉泰，向拉德季大人的手下报告，任务圆满完成。"
  T["Henry escapes from Vranik but Zbysek refuses to come or is left behind. Henry returns to Rataj alone and reports without the prisoner."] = "亨利从弗拉尼克逃了出来，但巴舍克不肯走或被落下了。亨利独自回到拉泰，没带回俘虏就去报告。"
  T["Henry visits Lukesh's hideout and brings him the iron ration he needs, completing the quest successfully. Lukesh is relieved and the quest ends on good terms."] = "亨利去鲁克斯的藏身处，给他带去急需的应急物资，任务完成。鲁克斯松了口气，双方关系融洽。"
  T["Lukesh dies before Henry can deliver the ration, causing the quest to be cancelled with no resolution. The quest fails and is abandoned."] = "亨利还没把物资送到，鲁克斯就死了，任务取消，没有结果。任务失败并被放弃。"
  T["Henry and the Bohemian soldiers successfully repel the Cuman attack at the bridge and stream, completing the battle and triggering the final victory cutscene. The quest concludes with the signal to the defence quest."] = "亨利和波希米亚士兵在桥头和溪边成功击退库曼人的进攻，打完这一仗，触发最后的胜利过场动画。任务结束，并向防御任务发出信号。"
  T["Too many Bohemian soldiers are killed during the skirmish (fewer than 6 alive in v1, fewer than 2 in v2), causing a Game Over with reason LostABattle."] = "小规模战斗中波希米亚士兵阵亡太多（v1 中活着的不到 6 人，v2 中不到 2 人），游戏结束，原因是 LostABattle。"
  T["Henry leaves the designated battlefield area during the v2 battle phase, triggering an immediate Game Over with reason Q_IR_FledBattle."] = "v2 战斗阶段亨利离开了指定的战场范围，立即游戏结束，原因是 Q_IR_FledBattle。"
  T["Henry ignores the call to battle and the failTimeout objective is cancelled (time runs out), triggering a Game Over with reason Q_IR_IgnoredBattle."] = "亨利对参战的召唤置之不理，failTimeout 目标被取消（时间用完），游戏结束，原因是 Q_IR_IgnoredBattle。"
  T["Henry steals all three items (bag, scarf, tinderbox) for the jealous groom and delivers them, allowing the groom to spread damaging gossip about his rival. The groom then leaves the area."] = "亨利替爱吃醋的马夫偷来全部三样东西（包、围巾、火绒盒）交给他，马夫得以散布中伤情敌的流言。之后马夫离开了这一带。"
  T["The groom dies before the quest can be completed, causing the quest to be cancelled outright."] = "任务完成之前马夫死了，任务直接取消。"
  T["Henry gathers the required ingredients, has the herbwoman brew a poison, places it in the cow's feed, and waits for the cow to die. The quest ends with the cow dead by poison."] = "亨利凑齐所需的材料，请采药婆熬出毒药，掺进牛的饲料，等牛死去。任务以牛被毒死结束。"
  T["Henry secures Konrad Kyeser's release through legitimate or clever means, escorts him safely to Talmberk, and reports to Fejfar. Pejchar is dealt with before reaching Talmberk."] = "亨利用正当或巧妙的办法让康拉德·吉赛尔获准离开，平安护送他到塔尔木堡，再向费法尔汇报。到塔尔木堡之前，培沙已经被摆平。"
  T["Kyeser reaches Talmberk but Pejchar catches up and must be killed near the camp; Kyeser is angry about the violence but the quest concludes."] = "吉赛尔到了塔尔木堡，但培沙追了上来，只能在营地附近杀掉他。吉赛尔对这场流血很恼火，不过任务照样结束。"
  T["Henry beats Kyeser into submission and forcibly drags him to Talmberk rather than convincing him to go willingly."] = "亨利没有说服吉赛尔自愿上路，而是把他打服了，硬拖到塔尔木堡。"
  T["Henry has the scribe forge travel documents for Karel to approve, bypassing the need to legitimately obtain permission for Kyeser to leave."] = "亨利让抄写员伪造通行文书，交给卡雷尔大人批准，绕过了正式申请让吉赛尔离开的手续。"
  T["Henry bribes Karel or ruins him at dice to obtain approval for Kyeser's departure without forging documents."] = "亨利贿赂卡雷尔大人，或掷骰子让他输得精光，换来让吉赛尔离开的批准，不必伪造文书。"
  T["Henry helps Jan Zajic and the poachers survive the glade ambush by siding with the poachers or otherwise ensuring the soldiers are defeated, saving Zajic who then retreats to the cave. The quest completes normally and triggers the follow-on q_master_main objective."] = "亨利站到偷猎者一边，或用别的办法确保士兵被打败，帮韩内津·黑尔和偷猎者们挺过林间空地的伏击。黑尔得救，退回山洞。任务正常完成，并触发后续的 q_master_main 目标。"
  T["Jan Zajic is killed during or after the glade fight. The engine detects zajicIsDead completed, clears Henry's superfaction, and immediately cancels the quest."] = "韩内津·黑尔在林间空地的战斗中或战斗后被杀。引擎检测到 zajicIsDead 完成，清除亨利的所属阵营，立即取消任务。"
  T["Mikulas is killed at any point while the quest is active. The BT watches mikulasIsDead via a QuestObjectiveGate and cancels the quest unconditionally."] = "任务进行中尼古拉斯在任何时候被杀，行为树都会通过 QuestObjectiveGate 监视 mikulasIsDead，无条件取消任务。"
  T["Black Lukes is killed before the goToField objective is started. The BT gate on lukesIsDead cancels the quest as long as goToField has not yet been reached."] = "goToField 目标开始之前布莱克·鲁克斯被杀。只要还没到 goToField，行为树里针对 lukesIsDead 的条件就会取消任务。"
  T["Ondrej (the innkeeper) is killed before the returnTankardHidden hidden step is completed. The BT gate on ondrejIsDead cancels the quest while that condition holds."] = "隐藏步骤 returnTankardHidden 完成之前，酒馆掌柜安德鲁被杀。只要这个条件成立，行为树里针对 ondrejIsDead 的条件就会取消任务。"
  T["Henry chooses to side with the soldiers in the glade decision dialogue. The BT immediately sets Henry's superfaction to the rangers side, starts the pursuit objective in q_hareHunt, and cancels this quest."] = "在林间空地的抉择对话里，亨利选择站到士兵一边。行为树立即把亨利的所属阵营设为猎场看守一方，开始 q_hareHunt 里的追捕目标，并取消本任务。"
  T["Henry delivers Vincent's last will to Father Fabian in Sasau, ensuring the disinheritance of Elijah is properly recorded. The quest ends with the will in the parson's hands."] = "亨利把文森特的遗嘱交给莎邵的费比安神父，确保剥夺以利亚继承权一事被正式记录。任务以遗嘱交到神父手里结束。"
  T["Henry loses or abandons the will without delivering it, and Cenek (Vincent) is still alive. The will is never delivered and Henry receives 500 groschen, presumably from Elias or as a bribe to suppress it."] = "亨利弄丢或扔下了遗嘱，没有送到，文森特还活着。遗嘱始终没有送到，亨利拿到 500 格罗申，大概是以利亚给的，或是让他压下遗嘱的封口费。"
  T["Vincent dies from illness before the will can be delivered, rendering it moot. Elias returns home to Merhojed as the heir by default."] = "遗嘱送到之前文森特就病死了，遗嘱也就没了意义。以利亚理所当然地以继承人身份回到莫霍杰德。"
  T["Vincent dies (by violence or other means) and Elias returns to Merhojed to claim his inheritance. The will was never successfully delivered."] = "文森特死了（死于暴力或其他原因），以利亚回到莫霍杰德继承家产。遗嘱始终没有送到。"
  T["Henry completes both reading lessons with the scribe in Uzhitz, reads both books, and returns to the scribe a second time, fully learning to read. The quest ends with the quest completed state and save_questEnded marked."] = "亨利跟乌兹茨的文书上完两节识字课，读完两本书，再回去找文书一次，彻底学会了识字。任务以完成状态结束，并记下 save_questEnded。"
  T["Henry finds Hynek in the cave, learns what he needs, and lets him go free. Hynek packs his belongings and leaves the area."] = "亨利在山洞里找到瑞奇，问出想知道的事，然后放他走。瑞奇收拾东西离开了这一带。"
  T["Henry finds Hynek and turns him over to the authorities. Hynek is taken away to prison."] = "亨利找到瑞奇，把他交给官府。瑞奇被押进了监狱。"
  T["Henry condemns Hynek to death during their confrontation, making him an enemy before the quest concludes."] = "对峙时亨利决意处死瑞奇，任务结束前瑞奇就成了他的敌人。"
  T["Hynek dies before Henry can confront him, cutting the quest short without resolution."] = "亨利还没找到瑞奇对质，瑞奇就死了，任务草草结束，没有结果。"
  T["Henry never investigates Hynek's whereabouts and the quest ends without finding him, logged as an unresolved search."] = "亨利始终没去打听瑞奇的下落，任务结束时也没找到他，记为一次没有结果的搜寻。"
  T["Henry acquires the forbidden book (Sufficientia) for Brother Nevlas and brings it to him. Cizek's nightly library visits are cancelled and the quest concludes after the book is handed over."] = "亨利替内弗拉斯修士弄到禁书《Sufficientia》交给他。西斯金夜里去图书馆的行动被取消，书交出去之后任务结束。"
  T["Henry joins the cirkators in the cellar for a night of drinking, brings them a wine keg, and the session concludes peacefully. The quest ends with the keg delivered and the monks satisfied."] = "亨利和巡察使们在酒窖里喝了一夜酒，给他们带去一桶葡萄酒，酒局平安散场。任务以酒桶送到、修士们心满意足结束。"
  T["Henry discovers the monks' secret drinking and reports their misconduct to the Prior. The cirkators are angered and Jodok's involvement is exposed to monastery authority."] = "亨利发现修士们偷偷喝酒，向长老告发了他们的恶行。巡察使们大为恼火，约都克参与其中的事也被修道院高层知道了。"
  T["Henry is thrown out of the monastery, either by refusing the task or being caught, and the quest ends with him expelled before resolving the monks' situation."] = "亨利拒绝了差事或被抓了现行，被赶出修道院，修士们的事还没解决，任务就以他被逐出结束。"
  T["Henry helps Ptacek woo Karolina successfully: delivers the letter and necklace, assists with the balcony serenade, and defends Ptacek against the butcher and his varlets. Ptacek wins the girl and the quest ends with a final cutscene."] = "亨利帮卡蓬追求卡洛莱娜，大获成功：送去情书和项链，帮着在阳台下唱小夜曲，还护着卡蓬挡住了屠夫和他的仆从。卡蓬赢得了姑娘的芳心，任务以最终过场动画结束。"
  T["Henry helps Ptacek through the quest but the balcony serenade or the confrontation with the butcher goes poorly, resulting in Ptacek failing to win Karolina. The quest still concludes after Henry reports back."] = "亨利帮卡蓬走完了任务，但阳台小夜曲或与屠夫的对峙没弄好，卡蓬没能追到卡洛莱娜。亨利回去复命后，任务仍会结束。"
  T["Henry refuses to help Ptacek, kills Karolina, or kills the butcher before the climactic confrontation, causing the quest to be cancelled with nothing achieved for Ptacek."] = "在最后的对峙之前，亨利拒绝帮卡蓬、杀了卡洛莱娜或杀了屠夫，任务取消，卡蓬一无所获。"
  T["Henry arrives at Neuhof on time, investigates the massacre, interrogates all survivors, tracks the bandits to the forest, and reports back to Bernard with full findings. Bernard praises Henry and the quest concludes with a promotion cutscene."] = "亨利按时赶到诺伊霍夫，调查屠杀，审问所有幸存者，把土匪追踪到林子里，再带着全部调查结果向巴纳德汇报。巴纳德夸奖了亨利，任务以晋升的过场动画结束。"
  T["Henry fails to reach the courtyard in time and Bernard's group rides to Neuhof without him. Henry catches up later and still participates in the investigation, but misses the initial departure."] = "亨利没能按时赶到庭院，巴纳德一行人没等他就骑马去了诺伊霍夫。亨利随后赶上，照样参加调查，只是错过了出发。"
  T["Zrzek leaves Neuhof before Henry can speak with him, so Henry cannot get his testimony. The quest continues but the lead on Zrzek is lost and Henry barks about his disappearance."] = "亨利还没找金杰谈话，金杰就离开了诺伊霍夫，亨利拿不到他的证词。任务继续，但金杰这条线索断了，亨利会随口提到他失踪了。"
  T["Henry completes the main campaign, culminating in the conquest of Talmberg and the epilogue. This is the intended ending of the base game story."] = "亨利走完主线剧情，以攻下塔尔木堡和尾声告终。这是本篇剧情预设的结局。"
  T["Henry successfully completes all three dates with Theresa, culminating in a romantic encounter in the barn. The relationship progresses naturally through conversation, activities, and mutual affection."] = "亨利和特丽莎顺利完成全部三次约会，最后在谷仓里有了一段浪漫时光。两人在交谈、一起做事和彼此的好感中自然走近。"
  T["Theresa dies during the quest, causing it to fail immediately. This is a catastrophic failure that ends any romantic possibility."] = "特丽莎在任务中死亡，任务立即失败。这是彻底的失败，任何恋爱的可能都没了。"
  T["Henry fails to show up or leaves Theresa waiting during the first date, damaging the relationship and causing the quest to fail."] = "第一次约会亨利没露面，或让特丽莎干等，两人关系受损，任务失败。"
  T["Henry abandons Theresa during the second date at the pub, failing to complete the evening and damaging their relationship."] = "第二次约会在酒馆时亨利丢下了特丽莎，没陪她过完这个晚上，两人关系受损。"
  T["Henry leaves Theresa before the romantic conclusion in the barn, failing to complete the final date and ending the quest unsuccessfully."] = "谷仓里的浪漫结局到来之前，亨利离开了特丽莎，最后一次约会没完成，任务以失败告终。"
  T["Henry's poor reputation with Theresa prevents the dates from progressing. The relationship cannot advance due to low standing."] = "特丽莎对亨利的好感太低，约会无法推进。关系停滞不前。"
  T["Henry loses the fight at the pub during the second date but the relationship continues. This affects rewards but doesn't end the quest."] = "第二次约会时亨利在酒馆打架输了，但两人的关系还在继续。这会影响奖励，但不会让任务结束。"
  T["Henry wins the fight at the pub during the second date, impressing Theresa and earning a positive outcome for that portion of the quest."] = "第二次约会时亨利在酒馆打架赢了，让特丽莎刮目相看，这一段的结果很好。"
  T["Henry explores the mines, negotiates or deals with Nemoj peacefully, escorts the miners out, and reports back to Fejfar. The miners are freed and the situation is resolved without unnecessary bloodshed."] = "亨利探查矿井，和尼莫伊谈判或用和平手段把他摆平，护送矿工们出来，再向费法尔汇报。矿工们获救，事情没有多流血就解决了。"
  T["Nemoj is killed during the quest (either by Henry or as a scripted consequence), which cancels the exploration objectives and skips directly to reporting to Fejfar."] = "尼莫伊在任务中被杀（死于亨利之手或脚本安排），探查目标随之取消，直接跳到向费法尔汇报。"
  T["Zuzana escapes from the mines during the quest, triggering a cutscene that teleports her to Pirkstein. The quest can still be completed but with this side consequence noted."] = "任务中祖札娜从矿井逃了出去，触发一段过场动画，把她传送到皮克斯坦因。任务仍可完成，只是记下了这个附带后果。"
  T["Henry discovers the treasure belongs to Brother Cizek, reports it to the prior or has Cizek arrested, resolving the quest through proper monastic authority. The quest ends after finding whose treasure it is and completing the report/arrest chain."] = "亨利查明宝藏属于西斯金，向长老告发或让人逮捕西斯金，经由修道院的正当权力解决了事情。查出宝藏归谁、完成告发或逮捕之后，任务结束。"
  T["Brother Cizek is killed during the quest, causing it to be cancelled rather than completed properly."] = "西斯金在任务中被杀，任务取消，没能正常完成。"
  T["Henry leaves the monastery before resolving the treasure mystery, abandoning the quest."] = "宝藏之谜还没解开，亨利就离开了修道院，放弃了任务。"
  T["Henry stole items from Cizek's stash and failed to return them within the allotted time, causing Cizek to become permanently hostile toward Henry."] = "亨利偷了西斯金藏着的东西，没在限定时间内还回去，西斯金从此对亨利怀恨在心。"
  T["Cizek catches Henry sneaking out at night, confronts him, and wins the fight, looting Henry in the process."] = "西斯金撞见亨利夜里偷溜出去，上前对质，打赢了，顺手搜刮了亨利身上的东西。"
  T["Henry traces the ring through the parson, merchant, and herbalist, locates and exhumes the grave, searches the body, and reports back to the blacksmith with confirmation of his wife's identity. The blacksmith finally has closure."] = "亨利通过牧师、商人和草药师追查戒指的来历，找到坟墓并挖开，搜查尸体，再回去告诉铁匠，证实了死者是他的妻子。铁匠终于可以放下了。"
  T["Henry finds Ginger, deals with the bandits threatening him, reports to Bernard and Radzig, then convinces Ginger he can safely return to Neuhof. Ginger walks home and the quest ends happily."] = "亨利找到金杰，摆平威胁他的土匪，向巴纳德和拉德季汇报，再说服金杰可以平安回到诺伊霍夫。金杰走回了家，任务圆满结束。"
  T["Henry finds Ginger and reports to Bernard and Radzig, but tells Ginger he cannot return to Neuhof. Ginger leaves for parts unknown and the quest closes without a happy reunion."] = "亨利找到金杰，向巴纳德和拉德季汇报，却告诉金杰他不能回诺伊霍夫。金杰远走他乡，任务结束，没有团圆。"
  T["After Ginger spills the beans about the bandits, the timer expires and the bandits execute Ginger before Henry can protect him. The quest ends with Ginger dead."] = "金杰供出土匪的事之后，计时结束，亨利还没来得及保护他，土匪就处决了金杰。任务以金杰死去结束。"
  T["Henry collects all required herbs and delivers them to Brother Nicodemus. The quest concludes successfully with the herbarium complete."] = "亨利采齐所需的草药，交给尼可丹姆斯修士。草药集编成，任务圆满结束。"
  T["Henry gives the book to Brother Nicodemus, completing the quest via the alternative book-delivery path."] = "亨利把书交给尼可丹姆斯修士，通过交书这条路完成任务。"
  T["Brother Nicodemus dies before the quest is completed, causing the quest to be cancelled with no resolution."] = "任务完成之前尼可丹姆斯修士死了，任务取消，没有结果。"
  T["Henry and the thieves successfully rescue the captives from Talmberg, escape the castle undetected or after dealing with the wall guards, and report back to Borek. The quest ends with the final debriefing dialog."] = "亨利和盗贼们从塔尔木堡救出俘虏，要么神不知鬼不觉，要么先收拾掉城墙上的守卫，逃出城堡后回去向罗巴德复命。任务以最后的汇报对话结束。"
  T["The alarm is raised and Ptacek is injured during the escape; Henry must carry or save Ptacek while fleeing the castle, then report to Borek. The quest still completes successfully but via the alarm path."] = "警报响起，卡蓬在逃跑时受伤，亨利得背着或救下卡蓬逃出城堡，再向罗巴德复命。任务照样成功完成，只是走的是警报那条路。"
  T["Henry is discovered and the alarm is raised before the captives are freed; the stealth mission fails but Henry and the group still manage to flee the castle and report to Borek."] = "俘虏还没救出来，亨利就被发现，警报响起。潜入行动失败，但亨利和同伴们还是逃出了城堡，向罗巴德复命。"
  T["Ptacek is injured and Henry fails to save him within the 240-second timer; Ptacek bleeds out and the game triggers a Game Over with reason PtacekBledOut."] = "卡蓬受伤，亨利没能在 240 秒的计时内救下他，卡蓬失血而死，游戏结束，原因是 PtacekBledOut。"
  T["Henry abandons the mission by leaving the area before completing the objective; the toWalls objective is canceled and the game triggers a Game Over with reason NightRescueRanAway."] = "亨利还没完成目标就离开了区域，放弃了行动。toWalls 目标被取消，游戏结束，原因是 NightRescueRanAway。"
  T["Henry commits a crime against allied NPCs during the mission and is confronted; the game triggers a Game Over with reason NightRescueCrime."] = "行动中亨利对友方 NPC 犯罪，被人当面质问，游戏结束，原因是 NightRescueCrime。"
  T["Henry catches all three nightingales and returns them to Berthold the Huntsman, completing the quest successfully. Berthold takes the cages and the quest ends."] = "亨利抓回全部三只夜莺，交给猎人贝索德。他收下鸟笼，任务顺利完成。"
  T["Berthold the Huntsman dies before Henry can return the nightingales. The quest is cancelled and all bird traps are removed."] = "亨利还没把夜莺交回去，猎人贝索德就死了。任务取消，所有捕鸟陷阱都被撤走。"
  T["Henry pays off the debt to Pesek's miller, satisfying all parties. The quest ends cleanly with Pesek on good terms and the miller quests unlocked."] = "亨利还清欠磨坊主皮社科的债，各方都满意。任务干净利落地结束，和皮社科关系融洽，磨坊主的差事也随之解锁。"
  T["Henry recovers the ring (from Herman or the grave) and delivers it to Vojtech, resolving the debt through the ring's value. The quest ends with the debt cleared via the ring."] = "亨利找回戒指（从刽子手赫曼那里或从坟里），交给沃兹科，用戒指的价值抵了债。任务以戒指抵清欠债结束。"
  T["Pesek or Vojtech is killed, making the quest impossible to complete. The quest is cancelled by the engine when either death is detected."] = "皮社科或沃兹科被杀，任务无法完成。引擎一检测到其中一人死亡，就取消任务。"
  T["Henry ignores the debt long enough that the miller timer fires twice, activating enforcers who hunt him across Rattay. Pesek becomes hostile and Henry is unwelcome at the mill."] = "亨利一直不理这笔债，磨坊主的计时触发了两次，打手们出动，满拉泰追他。皮社科从此敌视亨利，磨坊也不欢迎他了。"
  T["Henry successfully pickpockets the training knife from Peshek behind the mill, completes the post-theft dialogue, and the quest ends normally. This is the only intended narrative ending for this tutorial quest."] = "亨利在磨坊后面成功从皮社科身上偷走练习用的匕首，说完偷窃后的对话，任务正常结束。这是这个教学任务唯一预设的剧情结局。"
  T["Henry investigates the plague, obtains a cure with Nikodem's help or brews it himself, and successfully administers it to the sick villagers. Merhojed survives and the quest ends with the village recovering."] = "亨利调查瘟疫，靠尼可丹姆斯修士帮忙或自己动手弄到药，成功给生病的村民用上。莫霍杰德挺了过来，任务以村子逐渐康复结束。"
  T["Henry brings the cure but not all villagers survive — some die before treatment reaches them. The quest still resolves as a partial success with the village recovering."] = "亨利带来了药，但没能救下所有村民，有些人等不到治疗就死了。任务仍算部分成功，村子慢慢康复。"
  T["Henry fails to bring the cure in time and all the sick villagers die. The quest ends in failure with Merhojed left as a ghost village."] = "亨利没能及时带来药，生病的村民全死了。任务以失败告终，莫霍杰德成了一座死村。"
  T["The illness timer expires before Henry delivers the cure — either because he never spoke with Melichar or because he obtained the cure but never brought it back. The quest is cancelled and the village is lost."] = "亨利还没把药送到，疫病计时就结束了：要么他从没找梅立恰尔谈过，要么弄到了药却始终没带回来。任务取消，村子没救了。"
end)
fill(function(T)
  T["Henry kills Melichar before the cure is delivered, causing the quest to be cancelled immediately. The village cannot be saved."] = "药送到之前亨利杀了梅立恰尔，任务立即取消。村子救不了了。"
  T["Henry kills Nikodem before he has diagnosed the illness and pointed Henry toward Mrhojedy, making it impossible to obtain the cure. The quest is cancelled."] = "尼可丹姆斯修士还没诊断出病症、指点亨利去莫霍杰德，亨利就杀了他，再也弄不到药。任务取消。"
  T["The companion quest q_captiveInMerhojed is completed before Henry ever speaks with Melichar about the plague, so the plague quest is cancelled with a note that Henry never investigated."] = "亨利还没和梅立恰尔谈过瘟疫，相关的 q_captiveInMerhojed 任务就完成了，于是瘟疫任务被取消，并注明亨利从未调查。"
  T["Henry and the Skalitz survivors successfully storm Pribyslawitz, defeat the Cuman boss and bandit boss Runt, and liberate the village. The quest ends with the post-battle cutscene and Istvan watching over the reclaimed settlement."] = "亨利和斯卡里茨的幸存者们攻进普拉比西拉维奇，打败库曼头目和强盗头子矮子，解放了村子。任务以战后过场动画结束，伊斯特万守望着夺回的村庄。"
  T["Henry leaves the battle area before the fighting is resolved, abandoning his allies. This triggers a Game Over with the reason 'FledBattle'."] = "战斗还没分出胜负，亨利就离开了战场，丢下了同伴。游戏结束，原因是 'FledBattle'。"
  T["Too many friendly soldiers are killed during the battle, causing the assault to collapse. This triggers a Game Over with the reason 'TooManyCasualties'."] = "战斗中友军阵亡太多，进攻崩溃。游戏结束，原因是 'TooManyCasualties'。"
  T["Henry is killed during the battle. This triggers a Game Over with the reason 'LostABattle'."] = "亨利在战斗中阵亡。游戏结束，原因是 'LostABattle'。"
  T["Henry scouts the bandit camp at Pribyslav, reports to Borek, gathers reinforcements, and leads the assault that retakes the fortified camp. The quest concludes with the battle preparation complete."] = "亨利侦察普拉比西拉维奇的强盗营地，向罗巴德汇报，召集援兵，带队发起进攻，夺回设防的营地。任务以战斗准备完成告终。"
  T["Henry wins the Rattay sword tournament. The quest completes successfully and he can collect his prize money and a special item or weapon from the tournament organizer."] = "亨利赢得拉泰的剑术比武。任务圆满完成，他可以从比武主办人那里领取奖金和一件特别的物品或武器。"
  T["Henry loses the tournament or is disqualified (e.g. by committing a crime in the arena area). The quest is cancelled with no reward."] = "亨利输掉比武或被取消资格（比如在比武场范围内犯罪）。任务取消，没有奖励。"
  T["Henry joins Bernard's assault on Wolflin's camp. Bernard's forces win the battle, Wolflin is killed, and Henry returns to Hanus to collect his reward."] = "亨利加入巴纳德对沃尔弗林营地的进攻。巴纳德的部队打赢了，沃尔弗林被杀，亨利回到瀚纳什大人那里领赏。"
  T["Henry joins the assault but Bernard's forces lose the battle. Henry must retreat back to Bernard's camp in defeat."] = "亨利参加了进攻，但巴纳德的部队打输了。亨利只能败退回巴纳德的营地。"
  T["Henry infiltrates Wolflin's camp disguised and negotiates a peaceful resolution, convincing Wolflin to stand down without bloodshed."] = "亨利乔装潜入沃尔弗林的营地，谈出了和平解决的办法，说服沃尔弗林罢手，没有流血。"
  T["Diplomacy breaks down and Wolflin challenges Henry to a duel; Henry wins the duel, killing Wolflin, then reports back to Bernard and returns to Hanus."] = "谈判破裂，沃尔弗林要和亨利决斗。亨利赢了决斗，杀死沃尔弗林，然后向巴纳德复命，再回到瀚纳什大人那里。"
  T["Henry loses the duel with Wolflin and flees the area; he must return to Bernard's camp having failed to resolve the situation."] = "亨利在决斗中输给沃尔弗林，逃离这一带。事情没能解决，他只能回巴纳德的营地。"
  T["Wolflin was killed before Henry joined Bernard's campaign; the quest acknowledges this and Henry proceeds to report back and collect the reward."] = "亨利加入巴纳德的征讨之前，沃尔弗林就已经被杀。任务认可这一点，亨利接着回去复命领赏。"
  T["Henry investigates the illegal press-gang operation in Sasau, attends the midnight mass at the church to witness the recruiters in action, and completes the quest by going to meet the recruiters. The criminal operation is exposed and dealt with."] = "亨利调查莎邵非法招募人手的勾当，半夜到教堂参加弥撒，亲眼看到招募者行事，再去和他们会面，任务完成。这桩罪行被揭穿，也得到了处置。"
  T["Henry returns to Skalitz, finds his parents' bodies, buries them, deals with Zbysek, fights Runt's man Prcek, and retrieves his father's sword. The quest ends with Henry leaving Skalitz having honoured his parents."] = "亨利回到斯卡里茨，找到父母的遗体并安葬，摆平巴舍克，与矮子一伙交手，夺回父亲的剑。任务以亨利告慰父母、离开斯卡里茨结束。"
  T["Henry follows the main story from Skalitz through every major chapter — Neuhof, Auschitz, Ledetchko, Timmy, Nest of Vipers, Baptism of Fire, the aftermath of Pribyslawitz, the counterfeiters, infiltration, the counter-offensive, retaking Talmberg, and finally the epilogue. This is the single linear ending of the overarching revenge quest."] = "亨利从斯卡里茨出发，走完主线的每一个主要章节：诺伊霍夫、乌兹茨、拉迪亚茨克、《吾友蒂米》、《虎狼之穴》、《战火洗礼》、普拉比西拉维奇的善后、伪币团伙、潜入敌营、反攻、夺回塔尔木堡，最后是尾声。这是贯穿全篇的复仇任务唯一的线性结局。"
  T["Henry rides with Kuno's band through all chapters — prologue, message, feast, trap, traitor, and battle — completing the full questline. The quest ends normally after the final battle."] = "亨利随库诺的部队走完所有章节：序幕、送信、宴会、陷阱、叛徒和决战，完成整条任务线。最后一战之后任务正常结束。"
  T["Kuno is killed at any point during the quest. His death triggers the destroy objective which cancels the quest (unless the battle sub-quest has the ignoreKunosDeath flag set)."] = "任务进行中库诺在任何时候被杀。他的死会触发 destroy 目标，取消任务（除非决战支线设了 ignoreKunosDeath 标记）。"
  T["One or more of Kuno's band members (Jan Brtnik, Petr Brtnik, Provaznik, Stepan, or Nemec) is killed, triggering the oneOfKunobandIsDead chain."] = "库诺部队里有一个或几个人（杨·贝尔曼、彼得·贝尔曼、追女者、斯蒂芬·弗赖清或“石头”）被杀，触发 oneOfKunobandIsDead 这一连串后果。"
  T["Henry successfully passes the ring through the full chain of Kunoband members — Provaznik, Nemec, Stepan, Jan, Petr — and finally delivers it to Kuno, completing the Bacchus drinking game ritual. The quest ends with the ring in Kuno's hands and the band satisfied."] = "亨利让戒指在库诺部队的成员之间传完一圈（追女者、“石头”、斯蒂芬、杨、彼得），最后交到库诺手里，完成酒神巴克斯的拼酒仪式。任务以戒指交到库诺手中、众人尽兴结束。"
  T["The quest is forcibly cancelled because a member of Kunoband dies, the band leaves camp prematurely, or Kuno betrays the group (cs_kunoLeaves in q_rides_battle fires). The ring ritual can never be completed and the quest is abandoned."] = "库诺部队里有人死亡、部队提前离开营地，或库诺背叛大家（q_rides_battle 里的 cs_kunoLeaves 触发），任务被强制取消。戒指仪式再也完不成，任务就此放弃。"
  T["Kuno agrees to stay and fight alongside Henry. The two sides clash in a full skirmish, Hagen's band is defeated, and Henry reports the outcome to Sir Radzig."] = "库诺答应留下来和亨利并肩作战。双方打了一场全面的遭遇战，哈根的人马被打败，亨利向拉德季大人报告战果。"
  T["Kuno is bribed or persuaded to leave, so Henry faces Hagen alone in a duel. Henry defeats Hagen (knocks him unconscious or forces surrender) and then reports to Sir Radzig."] = "库诺被收买或被说动离开，亨利只好独自和哈根决斗。亨利打败哈根（打晕他或逼他认输），然后向拉德季大人报告。"
  T["Kuno leaves and Henry duels Hagen one-on-one, but kills him outright instead of sparing him. Hagen's band turns hostile and Henry must deal with the fallout before reporting to Radzig."] = "库诺离开，亨利和哈根单挑，却没有手下留情，当场杀了他。哈根的人马翻脸，亨利得先收拾这个烂摊子，再向拉德季报告。"
  T["Henry violates the agreed terms of the duel or battle (attacking outside the rules), causing Hagen's men to turn hostile and drive him off the field. The quest ends in disgrace."] = "亨利违反了决斗或战斗事先约定的规矩（在规则之外动手），哈根的手下翻脸，把他赶出了战场。任务以蒙羞告终。"
  T["Kuno is killed during the skirmish, cutting the battle short. Henry must still report to Sir Radzig, but the loss of Kuno is a significant failure."] = "库诺在遭遇战中被杀，战斗草草结束。亨利仍得向拉德季大人报告，但失去库诺是一次重大挫败。"
  T["Henry joins Kuno's band at the mill for the feast, participates in the fun (drinking, fighting, stories), and the group returns to camp together after the night ends. The quest concludes when kunoband_leave completes and the 'end' objective fires."] = "亨利随库诺的部队到磨坊赴宴，一起喝酒、打架、讲故事，夜里散场后大家一起回营地。kunoband_leave 完成、'end' 目标触发时任务结束。"
  T["Henry follows Kuno's band to the burned farm, investigates the attack, tracks down the bandits on the glade, helps defeat them, and reports the findings (letter and shield as evidence) to Racek. The quest ends successfully with the codex entry about Zoul unlocked."] = "亨利随库诺的部队来到被烧毁的农场，调查这次袭击，在林间空地追上土匪，帮着打败他们，再把调查结果（作为证据的信和盾牌）报告给拉德季大人。任务圆满结束，并解锁关于佐尔家族的典籍条目。"
  T["Kuno is killed during the quest, which causes the quest to be immediately cancelled via CancelQuest. The quest fails and cannot be completed."] = "库诺在任务中被杀，任务经 CancelQuest 立即取消。任务失败，无法完成。"
  T["Henry defeats the fighter convincingly, impressing Kuno. After the fight evaluation dialogue, Henry is invited to join Kuno's band."] = "亨利干脆利落地打败对手，让库诺刮目相看。库诺点评完这场比试，邀请亨利加入他的部队。"
  T["Henry loses the fight but performs well enough (health delta 0-15) that Kuno still invites him to join the band."] = "亨利输了比试，但表现还不错（生命值差在 0-15 之间），库诺还是邀请他入伙。"
  T["Henry loses the fight badly (health delta >15), failing to impress Kuno. The quest ends without Henry joining the band."] = "亨利输得很惨（生命值差超过 15），没能让库诺看上眼。任务结束，亨利没能入伙。"
  T["Kuno dies before or during the quest, causing it to be cancelled immediately."] = "库诺在任务开始前或进行中死亡，任务立即取消。"
  T["Henry tracks down Jakey (Kubajs), defeats him in combat, and has him taken to prison. The quest ends with Kubajs surrendering and being escorted away."] = "亨利追踪到杰克，在打斗中打败他，让人把他送进监狱。任务以杰克投降、被押走结束。"
  T["Kubajs knocks Henry unconscious during the confrontation and flees the area, escaping justice entirely."] = "对峙中杰克把亨利打晕，逃离这一带，彻底逍遥法外。"
  T["Henry questions Kubajs but ultimately leaves him tied up and walks away without resolving his fate, logging the outcome as abandoned."] = "亨利审问了杰克，最后却把他绑在那里扬长而去，没有决定他的下场，结果记为放弃。"
  T["Kubajs is killed during the quest, either before Henry can question him or during the confrontation, logging his death as the final outcome."] = "杰克在任务中被杀，可能在亨利审问他之前，也可能在对峙时，结果记为他的死亡。"
  T["The merchant Arnost dies before Henry can complete the investigation, cancelling the girl rescue thread and cutting off the normal quest resolution path."] = "亨利还没查完，商人欧内斯特就死了，救那个女孩的线索被取消，任务正常的结局之路也被切断。"
  T["Henry and Kuno's band survive the ambush and fight off the attackers. Henry speaks with Kuno after the battle, completing the quest successfully."] = "亨利和库诺的部队挺过伏击，打退了袭击者。战后亨利和库诺谈话，任务圆满完成。"
  T["Henry and Kuno survive the ambush but Henry does not speak with Kuno in time; the post-fight conversation times out and the quest ends."] = "亨利和库诺挺过了伏击，但亨利没有及时找库诺谈话，战后对话超时，任务结束。"
  T["The fight is lost or times out and Kuno is still alive but on the ground; the quest ends in failure with Kuno incapacitated."] = "战斗失败或超时，库诺还活着，但倒地不起，任务以失败告终，库诺失去行动能力。"
  T["The fight is lost or times out and Kuno dies during the ambush; the quest ends in failure with Kuno's death."] = "战斗失败或超时，库诺死于伏击，任务以失败告终。"
  T["Henry regularly visits Theresa, walks with her, and the relationship deepens into something more. Theresa is calm and receptive, and Henry may optionally bring her a dress as a gift."] = "亨利经常去看特丽莎，陪她散步，两人的关系越来越亲密。特丽莎平静而乐于接受，亨利还可以送她一条裙子作礼物。"
  T["Henry fails to visit Theresa for several days after their first meeting, causing her to become angry and the relationship to sour."] = "第一次见面之后，亨利一连好几天没去看特丽莎，她生了气，两人关系变僵。"
  T["Henry learns the bandit camp location (from Peta, Mach, or by accident) and reports it to the relevant party, completing the quest and unlocking the Nest of Vipers follow-up."] = "亨利得知强盗营地的位置（从蒂米、莫寇克那里，或者偶然发现），报告给相关的人，任务完成，并解锁后续任务《虎狼之穴》。"
  T["Henry stumbles upon the bandit camp on his own and reports its location without needing Peta or Mach's help."] = "亨利自己撞见了强盗营地，报告了位置，不需要蒂米或莫寇克帮忙。"
  T["Henry follows Mach back to the bandit camp directly, with Mach revealing the location himself, then reports it."] = "亨利跟着莫寇克直接回到强盗营地，由莫寇克自己暴露了位置，然后报告上去。"
  T["The bandits find Peta and kill her before Henry can protect her, resulting in a darker resolution where the bandits are grateful to Henry for leading them to her."] = "亨利还没来得及保护蒂米，强盗就找到她并杀了她，结局更惨：强盗们反倒感谢亨利把他们引到了她那里。"
  T["Henry kills Peta himself, either during a brawl or deliberately, cutting short her ability to provide information."] = "亨利亲手杀了蒂米，可能是在斗殴中，也可能是故意的，她再也提供不了情报。"
  T["Mach is killed during the quest, canceling his ability to lead Henry to the camp or pay a reward, and forcing Henry to find another path or abandon that route."] = "莫寇克在任务中被杀，再也不能带亨利去营地或付报酬，亨利只能另找门路，或者放弃这条路。"
  T["Mirka dies before Henry can get information about Peta's whereabouts from her, triggering a fallback hint and blocking the normal investigation path."] = "亨利还没从米尔卡那里问出蒂米的下落，米尔卡就死了，于是触发一条备用提示，正常的调查路线被堵死。"
  T["Henry completes the tracker quest by reaching the end objective. The quest serves as a background tracker that activates related quests (q_samopesh, q_pribyslav) when the bandit camp is found by accident."] = "亨利到达结束目标，完成这个追踪任务。这个任务是后台追踪器，偶然发现强盗营地时激活相关任务（q_samopesh、q_pribyslav）。"
  T["Henry stumbles upon the bandit camp by accident, triggering activation of the q_samopesh and q_pribyslav quests if they are not already started, and starting the findBanditCampByAccident objective in q_samopesh."] = "亨利偶然撞见强盗营地，如果 q_samopesh 和 q_pribyslav 还没开始就激活它们，并开始 q_samopesh 里的 findBanditCampByAccident 目标。"
  T["Henry completes his undercover stay at the monastery, fulfilling his duties and gathering information. The quest ends normally after the main story objective (Antonin going to jail or the saint investigation concluding) is resolved."] = "亨利结束在修道院的卧底生活，尽了本分，也收集到了情报。主线目标了结之后（安东尼斯入狱，或寻找圣人一事收尾），任务正常结束。"
  T["Henry accumulates too many rule violations and is expelled from the monastery, cancelling the quest. He is kicked out via cutscene and loses access to the monastery."] = "亨利违规次数太多，被逐出修道院，任务取消。过场动画里他被赶了出去，再也进不了修道院。"
  T["One of the key apprentice monks (Antonin, Cizek, Lukas, or Jodok) is killed during the quest, forcing it to end prematurely. The side quests are cancelled and the quest concludes via endQuest."] = "关键的学徒修士（安东尼斯、西斯金、卢卡斯或约都克）中有一人在任务中被杀，任务被迫提前结束。支线任务被取消，本任务经 endQuest 收尾。"
  T["The linked quest q_searchForSaint reaches a conclusion (Antonin goes to jail or Henry kills the saint and leaves the monastery), which triggers this quest to end. Henry retrieves his belongings and the monastery chapter closes."] = "关联任务 q_searchForSaint 有了结局（安东尼斯入狱，或亨利杀了“圣人”离开修道院），本任务随之结束。亨利取回自己的东西，修道院这一章画上句号。"
  T["Henry defeats Antonin in the duel triggered by the bailiff confrontation, and Antonin is taken to jail in Rataje. The true saint is exposed and justice is served through lawful means."] = "在执政官面前的对质引发了决斗，亨利在决斗中打败安东尼斯，安东尼斯被押进拉泰的监狱。真正的“圣人”被揭穿，正义依法得到伸张。"
  T["Henry kills Antonin directly (or kills the apprentice, or uses the killSaint objective), bypassing any lawful resolution. The quest ends with Antonin dead at Henry's hand."] = "亨利直接杀了安东尼斯（或者杀了那个学徒，或者用了 killSaint 目标），绕过任何合法的解决方式。任务以安东尼斯死在亨利手里结束。"
  T["Henry defeats Antonin in the duel after Antonin escapes to the bandits, killing him in the process. The quest ends with Antonin dead but through a forced confrontation rather than lawful arrest."] = "安东尼斯逃到强盗那里之后，亨利在决斗中打败并杀了他。任务以安东尼斯死去结束，但他是在强行对决中被杀的，没有被依法逮捕。"
  T["Henry declines Antonin's offer and fights him; if Antonin is beaten he is killed and the quest ends, but if Henry loses it is game over. Antonin dies without proper justice."] = "亨利拒绝安东尼斯的提议，与他交手。安东尼斯若被打败就会被杀，任务结束，亨利若输了则游戏结束。安东尼斯死了，却没有受到应有的审判。"
  T["Henry fails to confront Antonin in time after the escape cutscene; the antoninRunAway_timer expires, Antonin flees the monastery entirely and is cleared from the world, leaving the quest unresolved."] = "逃跑的过场动画之后，亨利没有及时找安东尼斯对质，antoninRunAway_timer 到期，安东尼斯彻底逃离修道院，从世界中被清除，任务悬而未决。"
  T["Henry successfully learns the Sasau blacksmith's tempering ditty, reports back to the Ledetchko blacksmith with the correct verse, and receives a high reward. The quest ends cleanly with full completion."] = "亨利学会了莎邵铁匠的淬火歌谣，把正确的歌词带回去告诉拉迪亚茨克的铁匠，拿到丰厚的报酬。任务干净利落地全部完成。"
  T["Henry reports back to the Ledetchko blacksmith but fails the speech check or delivers an imperfect account, receiving only a low reward before the quest ends."] = "亨利回去找拉迪亚茨克的铁匠，但口才检定没过，或者转述得不完整，任务结束前只拿到一点报酬。"
  T["Henry's initial report to the Ledetchko blacksmith fails the poem check, but he corrects it via fixReport and still completes the quest."] = "亨利第一次向拉迪亚茨克的铁匠转述时没通过歌谣检定，但他通过 fixReport 改了过来，照样完成了任务。"
  T["One or both smiths die during the quest, causing all active objectives to be cancelled and the quest to fail without resolution."] = "一个或两个铁匠在任务中死亡，所有进行中的目标被取消，任务失败，没有结果。"
  T["Henry completes all his errands, helps his father forge the sword, and receives it before the Cumans attack Skalitz. This is the intended successful completion of the prologue."] = "亨利办完所有差事，帮父亲打好那把剑，在库曼人袭击斯卡里茨之前拿到了它。这是序章预设的成功结局。"
  T["Henry retrieves the nails from the chest and delivers them to Tereza, ending the quest via the alternate nail-delivery path rather than receiving the sword directly."] = "亨利从箱子里取出钉子交给特丽莎，任务经由送钉子这条备用路线结束，没有直接拿到剑。"
  T["Henry fights Ota fairly and wins the duel, then collects his reward from Zach the blacksmith. Zach's armour is vindicated and Henry earns his pay as champion."] = "亨利和奥塔公平地打了一场，赢了决斗，然后找铁匠扎克领赏。扎克的盔甲经受住了考验，亨利作为替他出战的勇士拿到了报酬。"
  T["Henry accepts Ota's secret counteroffer to throw the fight, deliberately loses the duel, and collects a generous payment from Ota. Zach's armour loses prestige but Henry profits from the arrangement."] = "亨利接受了奥塔暗中开出的条件，故意输掉决斗，从奥塔那里拿到一大笔钱。扎克的盔甲名声受损，亨利却从这桩交易中得了好处。"
  T["Instead of arranging a duel, Henry steals Ota's armour from his workshop and brings it to Zach, who rewards him for the theft. The duel never takes place."] = "亨利没有安排决斗，而是从奥塔的工坊偷走盔甲交给扎克，扎克为此给了他报酬。决斗始终没有发生。"
  T["Henry kills the Bailiff, Ota, or Zach, making the quest impossible to complete. The quest is cancelled immediately upon the death of any of these key characters."] = "亨利杀了执政官、奥塔或扎克，任务无法完成。这几个关键人物中任何一个死去，任务立即取消。"
  T["Henry and both Matus and Fricek successfully steal the money transport, share the loot at the hangman's tree, and the quest ends with everyone celebrating. Both companions survive and receive their cut."] = "亨利和马修、弗利兹一起成功劫下运钱的车，在绞刑树下分赃，任务以众人庆祝结束。两个同伴都活着，也都拿到了自己那份。"
  T["Henry completes the heist but one of the two companions (Matus or Fricek) dies during the operation. The survivor meets Henry at the hangman's tree to collect their share, and the quest ends."] = "亨利完成了抢劫，但两个同伴中有一个（马修或弗利兹）在行动中死了。活下来的那个在绞刑树下和亨利碰头分钱，任务结束。"
  T["Both Matus and Fricek die during or after the heist. Henry ends up with all the stolen money and the quest closes without sharing."] = "马修和弗利兹都在抢劫中或之后死了。所有抢来的钱都落到亨利手里，任务结束，不用分赃。"
  T["Henry refuses to pay Matus and Fricek their share at the hangman's tree (giveMoneyTimeOut expires or he provokes them), causing them to turn hostile. Henry keeps the entire sum and the quest ends."] = "亨利不肯在绞刑树下给马修和弗利兹分钱（giveMoneyTimeOut 到期，或他激怒了他们），两人翻脸。亨利独吞全部钱款，任务结束。"
  T["Henry takes the money bag from the chest himself (removeMoneyBagFromChest) without coordinating with Matus and Fricek, causing the quest to be canceled as a betrayal."] = "亨利没和马修、弗利兹商量，自己从箱子里拿走钱袋（removeMoneyBagFromChest），这算背叛，任务取消。"
  T["Matus gets hold of the money bag (matusHasBagOfMoney completes), triggering a reputation penalty and immediate quest cancellation — the heist falls apart due to Matus's betrayal."] = "马修拿到了钱袋（matusHasBagOfMoney 完成），触发声望惩罚，任务立即取消：马修的背叛让这次抢劫泡了汤。"
  T["Henry declines to participate in the heist from the start. Matus and Fricek head to camp without him and the quest ends without the robbery taking place."] = "亨利从一开始就拒绝参与抢劫。马修和弗利兹撇下他回了营地，抢劫没有发生，任务结束。"
  T["Henry helps the charlatan successfully scare the village by completing the haunting tasks and the night scaring phase, then speaks with the charlatan the morning after. The quest ends with the village believing in the revenant and the charlatan paid."] = "亨利完成闹鬼的各项差事和夜里吓人的环节，帮江湖骗子成功吓住了全村，第二天早上再去找江湖骗子谈话。任务以全村都相信有亡灵、江湖骗子拿到报酬结束。"
  T["The charlatan is killed at any point during the quest, causing it to be cancelled. Henry failed to protect the key NPC."] = "任务进行中江湖骗子在任何时候被杀，任务取消。亨利没能保护好这个关键人物。"
  T["The gossip hag is killed before Henry has spoken to her about the brave guy, removing a required quest NPC and cancelling the quest."] = "亨利还没找长舌妇问起那个胆大的家伙，长舌妇就被杀了，少了一个必需的任务人物，任务取消。"
  T["Henry is spotted too many times at the bandit camp or accumulates too many trespass strikes, causing the brave guys to report him to the village and the quest to fail."] = "亨利在强盗营地被发现的次数太多，或擅闯记录太多，几个胆大的家伙向村里告发了他，任务失败。"
  T["Henry successfully scares the bandits into leaving without killing them, completing the bandit sub-objective peacefully."] = "亨利没杀强盗，而是成功把他们吓跑了，和平地完成了强盗这项子目标。"
  T["All four bandits are killed instead of being scared away. Henry can blame the revenant for their deaths to gain extra fear factor."] = "四个强盗没被吓跑，全被杀了。亨利可以把他们的死推到亡灵头上，让村里更加害怕。"
  T["Henry and the Talmberg soldiers kill all the bandits attacking the barbican. The battle ends in victory and the post-battle cutscene plays."] = "亨利和塔尔木堡的士兵杀光了进攻外堡的强盗。战斗以胜利结束，播放战后过场动画。"
  T["Henry opens the barbican gate (via interaction trigger) during the battle, ending the engagement without killing all enemies. The post-battle cutscene plays."] = "战斗中亨利（通过互动触发器）打开外堡的大门，没有杀光所有敌人就结束了交战。播放战后过场动画。"
  T["The battle timer runs out before the bandits are defeated or the gate is opened, forcing the quest to end on a failure path through the shared end objective."] = "强盗还没被打败、大门也没打开，战斗计时就结束了，任务只能经由共用的结束目标走向失败。"
  T["Henry successfully completes all sub-tasks for the siege — securing meat, beer, potions, resin, a priest, and a healer — then reports to Borek after clearing the bandit camps, allowing the assault on Talmberg to proceed fully prepared."] = "亨利完成攻城的全部子任务（弄到肉、啤酒、药剂、松脂，请来神父和医师），扫清强盗营地后向罗巴德汇报，攻打塔尔木堡得以在准备充分的情况下进行。"
  T["After the trebuchet is attacked and Henry speaks with Divis, the quest ends immediately and transitions to the assault phase without completing the bandit camp clearance, bypassing the full preparation loop."] = "投石机遭袭、亨利和戴卫斯谈过之后，任务立即结束，转入攻城阶段，不必扫清强盗营地，跳过了完整的准备流程。"
  T["Henry fails to return the brewed potions to the camp in time, causing the potion sub-quest to expire and the soldiers to go without the alchemical boost."] = "亨利没能及时把熬好的药剂送回营地，药剂子任务过期，士兵们得不到药剂的加成。"
  T["The field medic Nikodem is killed before Henry can complete the healer sub-quest, cancelling the getHealer objective and leaving the army without a surgeon."] = "亨利还没完成医师子任务，随军医师尼可丹姆斯修士就被杀了，getHealer 目标取消，军队没有了外科医师。"
  T["Henry kills the innkeeper Ondrej himself, collapsing the beer supply chain and cancelling both beer-tracking objectives, leaving the soldiers without ale."] = "亨利亲手杀了酒馆掌柜安德鲁，啤酒供应断了，两个追踪啤酒的目标都被取消，士兵们没酒喝了。"
  T["Fejfar, a key camp contact, dies during the preparation phase, registering as a negative event in the quest's parallel tracking and marking a failed sub-outcome."] = "营地的关键联系人费法尔在准备阶段死亡，在任务的并行追踪中记为一次负面事件，标记一个失败的子结果。"
  T["Henry brings food, then goes to speak with the father figure, completing the quest. This is a linear test quest with no branching choices or failure states."] = "亨利带来食物，再去和父亲那样的长辈谈话，任务完成。这是一个线性的测试任务，没有分支选择，也没有失败状态。"
  T["The quest completes normally. This is a simple open-world utility quest with no branching narrative choices or moral consequences."] = "任务正常完成。这是一个简单的开放世界辅助任务，没有剧情分支，也没有道德后果。"
  T["Theresa completes all chapters of her story — the village, nails, escape, finding her brother, and returning — then transfers to the next level. This is the sole narrative ending for this linear prologue quest."] = "特丽莎走完自己故事的所有章节（村子、钉子、逃亡、寻找弟弟、归来），然后切换到下一张地图。这是这个线性序章任务唯一的剧情结局。"
  T["Henry kills the wolf before it reaches Blanka, she collects herbs undisturbed, and the quest ends with Blanka successfully gathering what she came for. This is the best possible outcome."] = "特丽莎在狼扑到比安卡之前把它杀了，比安卡安心采药，任务以她顺利采到想要的草药结束。这是最好的结果。"
  T["Henry was not guarding Blanka when the wolf appeared, kills or scares off the wolf, then has to find Blanka who fled. The quest still completes but Henry failed to protect her directly."] = "狼出现时特丽莎没守在比安卡身边，她杀死或赶走了狼，再去找逃跑的比安卡。任务照样完成，只是没能直接护住她。"
  T["Blanka already has belladonna at the start of the quest, so the herb-gathering excursion is skipped entirely and the quest ends immediately via the belladonaStarter shortcut."] = "任务开始时比安卡手里已经有颠茄，于是完全跳过采药这一趟，任务经 belladonaStarter 捷径立即结束。"
  T["Blanka is knocked unconscious at any point during the quest. The engine detects her unconscious state via DeadUnconsciousGate, completes blankaUnconscious, and the quest is cancelled via cleanUp."] = "任务进行中比安卡在任何时候被打晕，引擎通过 DeadUnconsciousGate 检测到她昏迷，完成 blankaUnconscious，任务经 cleanUp 取消。"
  T["The quest fails through a generic failure condition (e.g. Theresa abandons Blanka or another hard-fail trigger fires), cancelling the quest via cleanUp without any successful outcome."] = "任务因一般的失败条件而失败（比如特丽莎丢下比安卡，或别的硬性失败触发器触发），经 cleanUp 取消，没有任何成功结果。"
  T["Henry gathers all three required supplies (cloths/bandages, herbs, and water) and successfully treats Theresa's injured brother Frantisek. The brother survives and the quest ends with a cutscene of his recovery."] = "特丽莎凑齐全部三样东西（布条或绷带、草药和水），治好了受伤的弟弟弗兰特。弟弟活了下来，任务以他康复的过场动画结束。"
  T["Frantisek dies before Henry can treat him — either Henry arrives too late or fails to act in time. Completing brotherIsDead triggers a Game Over with reason 'game_over_simek'."] = "特丽莎还没来得及给弗兰特治伤，他就死了：要么来得太晚，要么没能及时动手。完成 brotherIsDead 会导致游戏结束，原因是 'game_over_simek'。"
  T["Henry and Theresa successfully escape the Cuman-occupied mill, reach the mines, and reunite with Simek and the others. The quest ends with the closing cutscene after Theresa stays outside the mine."] = "亨利和特丽莎从库曼人占领的磨坊逃了出来，到达矿洞，与塞穆尔等人会合。特丽莎留在矿洞外之后，任务以收尾的过场动画结束。"
  T["Henry leaves the designated escape area or is caught by the Cumans, triggering an immediate game over screen. The quest fails without any narrative resolution."] = "特丽莎离开了指定的逃跑区域，或被库曼人抓住，立即出现游戏结束画面。任务失败，没有任何剧情结局。"
  T["Henry completes the Theresa relationship events, including the stablehand/apprentice argument dialogue and optional treasure map. The quest ends after the start objective resolves."] = "亨利完成特丽莎的感情事件，包括马童和学徒争吵的那段对话，以及可选的藏宝图。开始目标了结后任务结束。"
  T["Henry completes the level transition sequence: data is prepared and transferred, a healing buff is applied, and the game switches to the Rataje DLC4 level where Theresa triggers a forced dialogue to conclude the quest."] = "切换地图的流程走完：游戏准备并转移数据，给亨利加上治疗效果，再切换到拉泰的 DLC4 地图，特丽莎在那里触发一段强制对话，任务结束。"
  T["Henry helps Johanka by ensuring Matthias invites her to the dance, either by bringing his lucky dice or getting Fritz to teach lockpicking, then reports back to Johanka with the result. The quest ends normally through the bringDice or makeSureMatejInvitesJohanka path."] = "特丽莎帮乔汉卡一把，确保马蒂亚斯邀请她去跳舞：要么带来他的幸运骰子，要么让弗利兹教开锁，然后把结果告诉乔汉卡。任务经由 bringDice 或 makeSureMatejInvitesJohanka 正常结束。"
  T["The quest window passes without Henry completing the task — the next-day timer fires, which cancels the end objective and causes the quest to be cancelled via CancelQuest. No meaningful outcome is achieved for Johanka."] = "任务的时间窗口过去了，差事却没办完：次日计时触发，取消结束目标，任务经 CancelQuest 取消。乔汉卡什么也没得到。"
  T["Johanka falls unconscious (or is knocked out) while the quest is active and the end objective is still pending. The DeadUnconsciousGate in the BT detects her unconscious state and cancels the end objective, triggering a CancelQuest."] = "任务进行中、结束目标尚未完成时，乔汉卡昏倒（或被打晕）。行为树里的 DeadUnconsciousGate 检测到她昏迷，取消结束目标，触发 CancelQuest。"
  T["The Cumans attack Skalitz. Henry witnesses the attack and the quest ends as the main story takes over."] = "库曼人袭击斯卡里茨。亨利目睹了这场袭击，任务结束，转入主线。"
  T["The Cumans attack Skalitz via the alternate cutscene path (Henry not present at the nails scene). Quest ends identically."] = "库曼人袭击斯卡里茨，走的是另一段过场动画（亨利不在送钉子那一幕）。任务的结束方式完全相同。"
  T["Henry completes the introductory monologue, optionally follows the dog to Drizek, and returns to Skalitz, ending the quest normally. This is the sole narrative path for this linear DLC intro quest."] = "特丽莎说完开场独白，可以跟着狗去找赫尔巴，然后回到斯卡里茨，任务正常结束。这是这个线性 DLC 开场任务唯一的剧情路线。"
  T["Henry finds the stolen silver and brings it to Father (the miller). The quest ends successfully with the silver returned."] = "特丽莎找到被偷的银子，交给父亲（磨坊主）。任务圆满结束，银子物归原主。"
  T["Henry already has the stolen silver at quest start and hands it over immediately, skipping the search entirely."] = "任务开始时特丽莎身上已经有那批被偷的银子，当场交了出去，完全跳过了寻找的过程。"
  T["Theresa declines to help search for the silver. The quest is logged as declined and does not proceed to recovery."] = "特丽莎不肯帮忙找银子。任务记为拒绝，不会推进到找回银子那一步。"
  T["Theresa is caught while searching for the silver, resulting in a bad outcome for her and the quest."] = "特丽莎找银子时被抓住，对她和任务来说都是糟糕的结果。"
  T["Nemoj, the guard at the mine, is killed during the quest, triggering a failure state."] = "矿洞的看守尼莫伊在任务中被杀，触发失败状态。"
  T["Theresa successfully helps all five survivors (Drizek, Sobehrd, Jarmila, Julian, and Maros) escape or recover. The quest ends normally via endQuest after all five xIsSaved objectives complete."] = "特丽莎成功帮全部五名幸存者（赫尔巴、波特·斯坦尼斯洛夫、雅德米拉、朱利安和莫拉什）逃出或恢复过来。五个 xIsSaved 目标全部完成后，任务经 endQuest 正常结束。"
  T["At least one survivor is saved but one or more die before Theresa can help them. The quest still ends via endQuest because survivorsSaved > 0 when all active survivors and markers are resolved."] = "至少救下了一名幸存者，但有一个或几个人没等到特丽莎的帮助就死了。所有进行中的幸存者和标记都了结时 survivorsSaved > 0，所以任务仍经 endQuest 结束。"
  T["Every survivor dies before Theresa saves anyone (survivorsSaved == 0). The engine calls CancelQuest instead of starting endQuest, ending the quest in failure."] = "特丽莎一个人也没救下，幸存者全部死亡（survivorsSaved == 0）。引擎调用 CancelQuest 而不是开始 endQuest，任务以失败告终。"
  T["Theresa completes her morning chores, helps her father with his tasks, retrieves the dress from the chest, and the quest ends with the bittersweet celebration cutscene. This is the main narrative conclusion of the quest."] = "特丽莎做完早上的家务，帮父亲干完活，从箱子里取出裙子，任务以那场苦乐参半的庆典过场动画结束。这是这个任务主要的剧情结局。"
  T["Henry collects all scattered pages and returns them to the librarian, who reassembles the book and rewards Henry with access to the forbidden books cabinet. The quest completes normally."] = "亨利找齐散落的书页，交还给图书馆修士。修士把书重新装订好，作为报答，允许亨利翻看禁书柜。任务正常完成。"
  T["The librarian dies before the quest can be completed, causing the quest to be cancelled outright with no resolution."] = "任务完成之前图书馆修士死了，任务直接取消，没有结果。"
  T["Henry enters the tournament and wins, then reports the victory to Ptacek. The quest ends with a successful outcome and the winner's reward."] = "亨利参加比武并获胜，然后向卡蓬报告胜利。任务圆满结束，拿到冠军的奖励。"
  T["Henry enters the tournament but loses, then reports the result to Ptacek. The quest ends without the prize but without failure."] = "亨利参加比武但输了，然后向卡蓬报告结果。任务结束，没有奖品，但也不算失败。"
  T["Henry fails to attend the tournament twice, missing both opportunities. The quest ends with a cancelled journal note and no reward."] = "两次比武亨利都没去，两次机会都错过了。任务结束，日志记为取消，没有奖励。"
  T["The main story quest q_counterOffensive begins, automatically cancelling or deactivating this quest before it can be completed."] = "主线任务 q_counterOffensive 开始，本任务在完成之前被自动取消或停用。"
  T["Henry investigates Svatopluk's death, survives or avoids the ambush, informs the blacksmith about Black Peter's treachery, and completes the quest with Cerny Petr still alive. The smith learns the truth and Henry receives a reward."] = "亨利调查斯瓦托普鲁克的死，挺过或躲开了伏击，把黑彼得的阴谋告诉铁匠，黑彼得还活着时完成了任务。铁匠得知真相，亨利拿到报酬。"
  T["Henry enters the tournament, defeats Cerny Petr in combat, and the quest resolves with Black Peter beaten publicly. Henry then reports back to the smith."] = "亨利参加比武，在比试中打败黑彼得，任务以黑彼得当众落败了结。然后亨利回去向铁匠复命。"
  T["Cerny Petr ambushes Henry with a poisoned weapon; Henry survives, discovers the poison plot, and reports the ambush to the blacksmith via the smithClosure sub-quest."] = "黑彼得用淬毒的兵器伏击亨利。亨利活了下来，发现了下毒的阴谋，再通过 smithClosure 子任务把伏击的事报告给铁匠。"
  T["Cerny Petr is killed during or outside the ambush encounter. The quest deactivates if it has not yet fully started, or continues to a reduced closure if it has, with Henry unable to bring Black Peter to proper justice."] = "黑彼得在伏击中或伏击之外被杀。如果任务还没正式开始，就会被停用；如果已经开始，就以简化的方式收尾，亨利没能让黑彼得受到应有的制裁。"
  T["The blacksmith is killed at any point while the quest is active, causing the quest to be immediately cancelled and a failure journal entry to be recorded."] = "任务进行中铁匠在任何时候被杀，任务立即取消，并记下一条失败的日志。"
  T["The quest's resolution is triggered by an external event before Henry formally receives it, skipping the investigation entirely and jumping straight to the end-quest-line closure."] = "亨利还没正式接到任务，外部事件就触发了任务的结局，完全跳过调查，直接跳到这条任务线的收尾。"
  T["Henry obtains a genuine tooth or bone relic of St. Procopius and returns it to Urban. Urban is satisfied and rewards Henry."] = "亨利弄到圣普罗科匹厄斯真正的牙齿或骨头圣物，交给厄班。厄班很满意，给了亨利报酬。"
  T["Henry obtains a fake bone from the charlatan and passes it off to Urban as a genuine relic. Urban's reputation suffers when the deception is discovered."] = "亨利从江湖骗子那里弄来一块假骨头，冒充真圣物交给厄班。骗局败露后，厄班的名声受损。"
  T["Henry places the sacred bowl in the crypt as part of the quest resolution, completing the bone quest through the bowl path."] = "作为任务结局的一部分，亨利把圣碗放进地下墓室，通过圣碗这条路完成了圣骨任务。"
  T["Urban dies during the quest, causing it to be cancelled outright with no resolution."] = "厄班在任务中死亡，任务直接取消，没有结果。"
  T["Henry successfully accompanies Ptacek to the baths, wins the fist fight against Slavoj, and the bathmaster is punished. The quest ends with the final cutscene and Henry deciding Slavoj's fate."] = "亨利陪卡蓬去澡堂，打赢了与斯拉法的拳斗，澡堂老板受到惩罚。任务以最终过场动画结束，由亨利决定斯拉法的下场。"
  T["The quest is cancelled because Zdena or Klara died before the quest could proceed, making it impossible to complete the bathhouse visit."] = "任务还没推进，泽戴娜或克拉拉就死了，澡堂之行无法完成，任务取消。"
  T["Henry failed to complete the quest before the in-game deadline, causing the quest to be cancelled via the timekeeper timeout."] = "亨利没能在游戏内的期限前完成任务，任务因计时器超时而取消。"
  T["Henry is caught trespassing while fetching wine and is thrown out of the town hall by the guard, failing to complete the errand."] = "亨利去取酒时擅闯被抓，被卫兵赶出市政厅，差事没办成。"
  T["Henry is arrested while attempting to obtain wine, ending up in jail and unable to complete the quest."] = "亨利想弄酒时被逮捕，进了监狱，无法完成任务。"
  T["Henry declines to get into the bath during the second dialog with Ptacek, taking an alternate path through the evening without bathing."] = "与卡蓬第二次对话时，亨利不肯下澡盆，这个晚上换了一条路过，没有泡澡。"
  T["Henry helps the Waldensian Bauer family escape by convincing them to flee, then reports the outcome to Hanus. The heretics are saved and the vicar's mission is subverted."] = "亨利说服信瓦勒度派的鲍尔一家出逃，帮他们逃走，然后向瀚纳什大人报告结果。异端得救，代理牧师的使命落了空。"
  T["The vicar dies (by Henry's hand or otherwise) after Henry has already accepted the quest, causing getRidOfVicar to complete and the quest to proceed to reporting to Hanus without saving the Bauers."] = "亨利接下任务之后，代理牧师死了（死于亨利之手或别的原因），getRidOfVicar 完成，任务转入向瀚纳什大人汇报，没能救下鲍尔一家。"
  T["Henry leaves the estate area before the supper cutscene completes and has not yet talked to the vicar about worship, or the timeout objective fires, causing the quest to be cancelled outright."] = "晚餐的过场动画还没结束、亨利也还没和代理牧师谈礼拜的事，他就离开了庄园，或者超时目标触发，任务直接取消。"
  T["Bauer and his wife are both killed before Henry can convince them to escape, causing the quest to be cancelled as there is no one left to save."] = "亨利还没说服鲍尔夫妇出逃，两人就都被杀了，没人可救，任务取消。"
  T["Henry helps Ales assign water-carrying and shit-carrying jobs to the applicants. All applicants are interviewed and jobs are finalized, completing the quest normally."] = "亨利帮阿历克斯给求职的人分派挑水和挑粪的活儿。所有求职者都面谈过，工作也都定了下来，任务正常完成。"
  T["Henry convinces Anezka to take the cook position at Hagen's house, giving her a better life. The quest ends with Anezka starting her new role as cook."] = "亨利说服阿格尼丝去商人哈根家当厨娘，让她过上更好的日子。任务以阿格尼丝开始当厨娘结束。"
  T["The quest is forcibly cancelled because a critical NPC (Vanek, Hagen, or two applicants) died, making it impossible to complete the job assignment."] = "关键人物（万尼克、商人哈根或两名求职者）死亡，工作分派无法完成，任务被强制取消。"
  T["Ales, the overseer managing the job assignments, was killed before the process could be completed, derailing the entire quest."] = "负责分派工作的监工阿历克斯在分派完成之前被杀，整个任务就此中断。"
  T["Henry successfully treats all three wounded patients (bandages Jan, fixes Tomas's broken leg, and obtains the diarrhoea potion for Filip), earning Sebastian's gratitude and a celebratory feast. The quest ends with the infirmary fully restored."] = "亨利治好全部三名伤员（给汉斯包扎、给托马斯接好断腿、给菲利普弄来止泻药），赢得塞巴斯蒂安大人的感谢和一场庆功宴。任务以医护所恢复如初结束。"
  T["Henry treats at least one but not all three patients before the quest resolves. The infirmary survives but not everyone was saved in time."] = "任务了结之前，亨利治好了至少一名伤员，但没能治好全部三名。医护所撑了下来，只是没能及时救下所有人。"
  T["All three patients die before Henry can treat them, either through neglect over too many in-game days or by Henry's hand. The quest ends in total failure with every wounded soul lost."] = "亨利还没来得及治疗，三名伤员就全死了：要么拖了太多天没管，要么死于亨利之手。任务彻底失败，伤员无一幸存。"
  T["Johanka is killed during the quest, which immediately cancels the entire quest regardless of how many patients Henry has already helped."] = "乔汉卡在任务中被杀，不管亨利已经帮了几个伤员，整个任务都会立即取消。"
  T["Henry successfully helps set the trap for Zajic, delivers the document, and is rewarded by Sir Divis with a promotion and hunting rights. The quest ends with the endQuest objective after the final cutscene with Divis."] = "亨利帮着给黑尔设下陷阱，交出文书，戴卫斯大人奖励他晋升和狩猎权。与戴卫斯的最终过场动画之后，任务以 endQuest 目标结束。"
  T["Zajic is killed during the quest, causing it to be cancelled. The trap cannot be sprung without Zajic alive."] = "黑尔在任务中被杀，任务取消。黑尔不活着，陷阱就设不成。"
  T["Marketa is killed during the quest, making it impossible to proceed with the kidnapping plan and causing the quest to be cancelled."] = "玛格丽特在任务中被杀，绑架计划无法推进，任务取消。"
  T["Mikulas is killed during the quest, preventing him from signing the document and causing the quest to be cancelled."] = "尼古拉斯在任务中被杀，没法在文书上签字，任务取消。"
  T["Henry knocks out Marketa but drops her body before reaching Zajic's cave hideout, causing the quest to fail with reputation penalties."] = "亨利打晕了玛格丽特，却在到达黑尔藏身的山洞之前把她扔下了，任务失败，还会受到声望惩罚。"
  T["Henry fails to complete the quest within the allotted time after Zajic honks his horn, causing the quest to be cancelled."] = "黑尔吹响号角之后，亨利没能在限定时间内完成任务，任务取消。"
end)
